  // =========================================================
  // 第二章：数据库层类型安全
  // =========================================================
  {
    id: "ts3-node-database-types",
    title: "数据库层类型安全",
    icon: "🗄️",
    group: "Node.js 后端开发",
    content: `## 数据库层类型安全：从 SQL 到对象的类型桥梁

### 数据库类型安全为何至关重要？

数据库是几乎所有后端应用的持久化层，也是类型安全最容易出现裂缝的地方。想象一下这个场景：你在代码中将某个字段定义为 \`number\` 类型，但数据库表中该字段实际是 \`VARCHAR\`；或者你重命名了一个实体属性，却忘记更新 SQL 查询中的列名；又或者你期望查询返回一个对象数组，但 LEFT JOIN 产生了 \`null\` 值，而你的类型定义没有反映这一点——这些问题轻则导致页面显示异常，重则引发数据损坏或安全漏洞。

在 Node.js 生态中，数据库访问经历了几个阶段：
1. **原生驱动阶段**：直接使用 \`pg\`、\`mysql2\` 等驱动，手写 SQL，结果是 \`any\` 类型的行对象数组
2. **查询构建器阶段**：Knex.js 等库提供了链式调用 API，但类型推导能力有限
3. **ORM 阶段**：TypeORM、Sequelize、Prisma 等 ORM 通过装饰器或 Schema 定义提供类型安全
4. **类型安全 SQL 阶段**：Kysely、sql-template-tag 等库利用 TypeScript 类型系统推导查询结果类型

本章我们将深入探讨如何利用 TypeScript 的高级类型特性，构建一个类型安全的数据库访问层。

### 数据库类型安全的核心挑战

在设计类型安全的数据库层时，我们需要解决以下核心问题：

1. **表结构与 TypeScript 类型的映射**：数据库列类型（INT, VARCHAR, TIMESTAMP, JSON 等）如何准确对应到 TypeScript 类型
2. **查询结果类型推导**：SELECT 选择了哪些列、JOIN 了哪些表、是否使用了聚合函数——这些都影响返回值类型
3. **nullable 列的处理**：数据库中允许 NULL 的列在 TypeScript 中应为联合类型 \`T | null\`
4. **插入与更新操作的类型**：INSERT 时自增 ID 不需要提供，但 UPDATE 时所有字段都是可选的
5. **事务类型**：事务中的操作应该共享同一个连接，且类型在整个事务上下文中保持一致
6. **迁移类型**：数据库迁移脚本本身也应该是类型安全的，防止迁移代码引入类型不一致

### SQL 模板字面量类型

TypeScript 4.1 引入了模板字面量类型（Template Literal Types），这为解析 SQL 字符串提供了强大的类型级编程能力。我们可以在类型层面解析 SQL 语句的结构——虽然这非常复杂（SQL 是一个相当复杂的语言），但对于常见的查询模式，我们可以提供一定程度的类型推导。

更实际的做法是使用**类型安全的查询构建器**模式：通过链式 API 构建查询，TypeScript 在每一步都能追踪当前选择的表、列和连接状态。

### Prisma 风格的 Schema 定义

Prisma 是目前最流行的类型安全 ORM 之一，它使用自己的 Schema 语言定义数据模型，然后生成类型安全的客户端。让我们理解其核心思想：

\`\`\`prisma
model User {
  id    Int     @id @default(autoincrement())
  email String  @unique
  name  String?
  posts Post[]
}

model Post {
  id        Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  title     String
  content   String?
  published Boolean  @default(false)
  authorId  Int
  author    User     @relation(fields: [authorId], references: [id])
}
\`\`\`

从这个 Schema，Prisma 生成：
- \`User\` 和 \`Post\` 类型，正确处理 nullable 字段
- \`UserCreateInput\` 类型用于创建操作（不包含自增 id）
- \`UserUpdateInput\` 类型用于更新操作（所有字段可选）
- \`UserWhereInput\` 类型用于查询条件
- 关系查询的类型推导（include/select）

### 类型安全的 Repository 模式

Repository 模式是一种常用的 DDD（领域驱动设计）模式，它在数据源和业务逻辑之间添加了一个抽象层。每个实体对应一个 Repository，提供类型安全的 CRUD 操作。

一个类型安全的 Repository 应该具备：
- 创建操作只接受实体类型中必要的字段（排除自增 id、自动生成的时间戳等）
- 更新操作接受部分字段，但不允许修改 id
- 查询方法返回正确的类型，包括 nullable 情况
- 分页查询返回包含总数、页信息的结构化结果
- 支持事务，确保事务内操作使用同一连接且正确提交或回滚

### 查询构建器的类型设计

设计一个类型安全的查询构建器需要巧妙运用 TypeScript 的泛型和条件类型。核心思路是：
- 查询构建器实例持有当前的"状态类型"（已选择的表、已添加的条件、是否有 JOIN）
- 每个方法（\`select\`, \`where\`, \`join\`, \`orderBy\`）返回一个新的类型化构建器实例
- 最终的 \`execute()\` 方法根据累积的类型信息推导返回值类型

例如：
- \`queryBuilder('users')\` 返回 \`QueryBuilder<'users', User, {}>\`
- \`.select('id', 'name')\` 返回 \`QueryBuilder<'users', Pick<User, 'id' | 'name'>, {}>\`
- \`.join('posts', 'users.id', 'posts.authorId')\` 将 Post 类型加入结果
- \`.where({ id: 1 })\` 添加条件但不改变结果类型
- \`.execute()\` 返回 \`Promise<Pick<User, 'id' | 'name'> & Post>[]\`

### 迁移类型

数据库迁移是维护数据库结构随代码演进的机制。类型安全的迁移应该：
- 对迁移中涉及的表和列进行类型检查，防止引用不存在的表或列
- 在迁移脚本中提供类型安全的 up/down 函数
- 跟踪哪些迁移已经执行（通常通过一个 _migrations 表）

### 本章代码示例概览

在本章的代码中，我们将构建一个类型安全的内存数据库和查询构建器，展示以下概念：
- 数据库 Schema 的类型定义（表结构映射到 TypeScript 类型）
- 类型安全的 Repository 基类，提供 CRUD 操作
- 支持链式调用的类型安全查询构建器
- INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE/SELECT 的完整类型推导
- 分页类型
- 简单的事务模拟
- SQL 模板标签的类型推导基础

虽然我们使用内存数据库来模拟（避免在沙箱中需要真实数据库），但类型设计完全可以应用到真实的数据库驱动上。
`,
    code: `// ============================================================
// 类型安全的数据库访问层模拟
// 使用内存数据库演示 Prisma/Kysely 风格的类型安全模式
// ============================================================

import { EventEmitter } from 'events';
import crypto from 'crypto';

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第一部分：数据库类型系统核心定义
// ------------------------------------------------------------

type ColumnType = 'string' | 'number' | 'boolean' | 'date' | 'json';
type TypeMapping = {
  string: string;
  number: number;
  boolean: boolean;
  date: Date;
  json: unknown;
};

interface ColumnDefinition {
  type: ColumnType;
  nullable?: boolean;
  primaryKey?: boolean;
  autoIncrement?: boolean;
  unique?: boolean;
  defaultValue?: unknown;
}

type TableSchema = Record<string, ColumnDefinition>;

type InferRowType<TSchema extends TableSchema> = {
  [K in keyof TSchema]: TSchema[K]['nullable'] extends true
    ? TypeMapping[TSchema[K]['type']] | null
    : TypeMapping[TSchema[K]['type']];
};

type InsertRowType<TSchema extends TableSchema> = {
  [K in keyof TSchema as TSchema[K]['autoIncrement'] extends true
    ? never
    : TSchema[K]['defaultValue'] extends undefined
      ? K
      : K]?: TSchema[K]['nullable'] extends true
    ? TypeMapping[TSchema[K]['type']] | null
    : TypeMapping[TSchema[K]['type']];
} & {
  [K in keyof TSchema as TSchema[K]['autoIncrement'] extends true
    ? never
    : TSchema[K]['defaultValue'] extends undefined
      ? never
      : never]: never;
};

type UpdateRowType<TSchema extends TableSchema> = {
  [K in keyof TSchema as TSchema[K]['primaryKey'] extends true ? never : K]?: TSchema[K]['nullable'] extends true
    ? TypeMapping[TSchema[K]['type']] | null
    : TypeMapping[TSchema[K]['type']];
};

type WhereCondition<T> = {
  [K in keyof T]?: T[K] | { $eq?: T[K]; $ne?: T[K]; $gt?: T[K]; $lt?: T[K]; $gte?: T[K]; $lte?: T[K]; $in?: T[K][]; $like?: string; };
};

interface PaginationResult<T> {
  data: T[];
  total: number;
  page: number;
  pageSize: number;
  totalPages: number;
  hasNext: boolean;
  hasPrev: boolean;
}

interface OrderBy<T> {
  field: keyof T & string;
  direction: 'asc' | 'desc';
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第二部分：定义数据库 Schema
// ------------------------------------------------------------

interface DatabaseSchema {
  users: {
    id: { type: 'number'; primaryKey: true; autoIncrement: true };
    email: { type: 'string'; unique: true };
    name: { type: 'string'; nullable: true };
    age: { type: 'number'; nullable: true };
    role: { type: 'string'; defaultValue: 'user' };
    createdAt: { type: 'date'; defaultValue: () => Date };
    updatedAt: { type: 'date'; defaultValue: () => Date };
  };
  posts: {
    id: { type: 'number'; primaryKey: true; autoIncrement: true };
    title: { type: 'string' };
    content: { type: 'string'; nullable: true };
    published: { type: 'boolean'; defaultValue: false };
    authorId: { type: 'number' };
    viewCount: { type: 'number'; defaultValue: 0 };
    createdAt: { type: 'date'; defaultValue: () => Date };
  };
  comments: {
    id: { type: 'number'; primaryKey: true; autoIncrement: true };
    postId: { type: 'number' };
    authorId: { type: 'number' };
    content: { type: 'string' };
    createdAt: { type: 'date'; defaultValue: () => Date };
  };
}

type UserRow = InferRowType<DatabaseSchema['users']>;
type PostRow = InferRowType<DatabaseSchema['posts']>;
type CommentRow = InferRowType<DatabaseSchema['comments']>;

type UserInsert = InsertRowType<DatabaseSchema['users']>;
type PostInsert = InsertRowType<DatabaseSchema['posts']>;
type CommentInsert = InsertRowType<DatabaseSchema['comments']>;

type UserUpdate = UpdateRowType<DatabaseSchema['users']>;
type PostUpdate = UpdateRowType<DatabaseSchema['posts']>;

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第三部分：内存数据库存储引擎
// ------------------------------------------------------------

class DatabaseError extends Error {
  constructor(message: string, public readonly code: string) {
    super(message);
    this.name = 'DatabaseError';
  }
}

class UniqueConstraintError extends DatabaseError {
  constructor(table: string, field: string) {
    super(\`\${table} 表的 \${field} 字段违反唯一约束\`, 'UNIQUE_VIOLATION');
    this.name = 'UniqueConstraintError';
  }
}

class ForeignKeyError extends DatabaseError {
  constructor(message: string) {
    super(message, 'FOREIGN_KEY_VIOLATION');
    this.name = 'ForeignKeyError';
  }
}

class NotFoundError extends DatabaseError {
  constructor(table: string, id: number) {
    super(\`\${table} 表中未找到 id=\${id} 的记录\`, 'NOT_FOUND');
    this.name = 'NotFoundError';
  }
}

type TableData = Record<string, any[]>;

class InMemoryDatabase extends EventEmitter {
  private tables: TableData = {};
  private autoIncrementCounters: Record<string, number> = {};
  private inTransaction = false;
  private transactionBackup: TableData | null = null;

  constructor() {
    super();
    this.tables = { users: [], posts: [], comments: [] };
    this.autoIncrementCounters = { users: 0, posts: 0, comments: 0 };
  }

  beginTransaction(): void {
    if (this.inTransaction) {
      throw new DatabaseError('已有进行中的事务', 'TRANSACTION_ERROR');
    }
    this.inTransaction = true;
    this.transactionBackup = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(this.tables));
    for (const table of Object.keys(this.tables)) {
      (this.transactionBackup as TableData)[table] = [...this.tables[table]];
    }
    this.emit('transaction:begin');
    console.log('[事务] 开始事务');
  }

  commit(): void {
    if (!this.inTransaction) {
      throw new DatabaseError('没有进行中的事务', 'TRANSACTION_ERROR');
    }
    this.inTransaction = false;
    this.transactionBackup = null;
    this.emit('transaction:commit');
    console.log('[事务] 提交事务');
  }

  rollback(): void {
    if (!this.inTransaction || !this.transactionBackup) {
      throw new DatabaseError('没有进行中的事务', 'TRANSACTION_ERROR');
    }
    this.tables = this.transactionBackup;
    this.inTransaction = false;
    this.transactionBackup = null;
    this.emit('transaction:rollback');
    console.log('[事务] 回滚事务');
  }

  insert<T extends Record<string, any>>(tableName: string, data: Partial<T>, schema: TableSchema): T {
    const table = this.tables[tableName];
    if (!table) throw new DatabaseError(\`表 \${tableName} 不存在\`, 'TABLE_NOT_FOUND');

    const row: Record<string, any> = {};

    for (const [colName, colDef] of Object.entries(schema)) {
      if (colDef.autoIncrement) {
        this.autoIncrementCounters[tableName]++;
        row[colName] = this.autoIncrementCounters[tableName];
      } else if (data[colName] !== undefined) {
        row[colName] = data[colName];
      } else if (colDef.defaultValue !== undefined) {
        row[colName] = typeof colDef.defaultValue === 'function'
          ? colDef.defaultValue()
          : colDef.defaultValue;
      } else if (!colDef.nullable) {
        throw new DatabaseError(\`字段 \${colName} 不能为空\`, 'NOT_NULL_VIOLATION');
      } else {
        row[colName] = null;
      }
    }

    if (colHasUnique(schema, data, table)) {
      for (const [colName, colDef] of Object.entries(schema)) {
        if (colDef.unique && data[colName] !== undefined) {
          const exists = table.some(r => r[colName] === data[colName]);
          if (exists) throw new UniqueConstraintError(tableName, colName);
        }
      }
    }

    table.push(row);
    this.emit('record:insert', { table: tableName, record: row });
    return row as T;
  }

  findById<T>(tableName: string, id: number): T | null {
    const table = this.tables[tableName];
    if (!table) throw new DatabaseError(\`表 \${tableName} 不存在\`, 'TABLE_NOT_FOUND');
    return table.find(r => r.id === id) || null;
  }

  findMany<T>(
    tableName: string,
    options: {
      where?: Record<string, any>;
      orderBy?: { field: string; direction: 'asc' | 'desc' };
      limit?: number;
      offset?: number;
    } = {}
  ): T[] {
    const table = this.tables[tableName];
    if (!table) throw new DatabaseError(\`表 \${tableName} 不存在\`, 'TABLE_NOT_FOUND');

    let results = [...table];

    if (options.where) {
      results = results.filter(row => matchesWhere(row, options.where!));
    }

    if (options.orderBy) {
      const { field, direction } = options.orderBy;
      results.sort((a, b) => {
        const aVal = a[field];
        const bVal = b[field];
        if (aVal < bVal) return direction === 'asc' ? -1 : 1;
        if (aVal > bVal) return direction === 'asc' ? 1 : -1;
        return 0;
      });
    }

    if (options.offset) {
      results = results.slice(options.offset);
    }

    if (options.limit) {
      results = results.slice(0, options.limit);
    }

    return results as T[];
  }

  count(tableName: string, where?: Record<string, any>): number {
    const table = this.tables[tableName];
    if (!table) throw new DatabaseError(\`表 \${tableName} 不存在\`, 'TABLE_NOT_FOUND');
    if (!where) return table.length;
    return table.filter(row => matchesWhere(row, where)).length;
  }

  updateById<T>(tableName: string, id: number, data: Record<string, any>, schema: TableSchema): T {
    const table = this.tables[tableName];
    if (!table) throw new DatabaseError(\`表 \${tableName} 不存在\`, 'TABLE_NOT_FOUND');

    const index = table.findIndex(r => r.id === id);
    if (index === -1) throw new NotFoundError(tableName, id);

    const updated = { ...table[index], ...data, updatedAt: new Date() };
    table[index] = updated;
    this.emit('record:update', { table: tableName, record: updated });
    return updated as T;
  }

  deleteById(tableName: string, id: number): boolean {
    const table = this.tables[tableName];
    if (!table) throw new DatabaseError(\`表 \${tableName} 不存在\`, 'TABLE_NOT_FOUND');

    const index = table.findIndex(r => r.id === id);
    if (index === -1) throw new NotFoundError(tableName, id);

    table.splice(index, 1);
    this.emit('record:delete', { table: tableName, id });
    return true;
  }

  getTableData(tableName: string): any[] {
    return this.tables[tableName] || [];
  }
}

function matchesWhere(row: Record<string, any>, where: Record<string, any>): boolean {
  for (const [key, condition] of Object.entries(where)) {
    if (condition === null || condition === undefined) {
      if (row[key] !== condition) return false;
    } else if (typeof condition === 'object' && !Array.isArray(condition)) {
      for (const [op, value] of Object.entries(condition)) {
        switch (op) {
          case '$eq': if (row[key] !== value) return false; break;
          case '$ne': if (row[key] === value) return false; break;
          case '$gt': if (!(row[key] > value)) return false; break;
          case '$lt': if (!(row[key] < value)) return false; break;
          case '$gte': if (!(row[key] >= value)) return false; break;
          case '$lte': if (!(row[key] <= value)) return false; break;
          case '$in': if (!Array.isArray(value) || !value.includes(row[key])) return false; break;
          case '$like':
            if (typeof value === 'string' && typeof row[key] === 'string') {
              const pattern = value.replace(/%/g, '.*').replace(/_/g, '.');
              if (!new RegExp(\`^\${pattern}$\`, 'i').test(row[key])) return false;
            }
            break;
          default:
            if (row[key] !== condition) return false;
        }
      }
    } else {
      if (row[key] !== condition) return false;
    }
  }
  return true;
}

function colHasUnique(_schema: TableSchema, _data: Record<string, any>, _table: any[]): boolean {
  return true;
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第四部分：类型安全的 Repository 基类
// ------------------------------------------------------------

class Repository<T extends Record<string, any>, TInsert, TUpdate> {
  constructor(
    protected db: InMemoryDatabase,
    protected tableName: string,
    protected schema: TableSchema,
  ) {}

  create(data: TInsert): T {
    console.log(\`[Repository] 向 \${this.tableName} 插入记录\`);
    return this.db.insert<T>(this.tableName, data, this.schema);
  }

  findById(id: number): T | null {
    return this.db.findById<T>(this.tableName, id);
  }

  findOne(where: Partial<T>): T | null {
    const results = this.findMany({ where, limit: 1 });
    return results[0] || null;
  }

  findMany(options: {
    where?: Partial<T> | WhereCondition<T>;
    orderBy?: OrderBy<T>;
    limit?: number;
    offset?: number;
  } = {}): T[] {
    return this.db.findMany<T>(this.tableName, options as any);
  }

  async paginate(options: {
    where?: Partial<T> | WhereCondition<T>;
    orderBy?: OrderBy<T>;
    page?: number;
    pageSize?: number;
  } = {}): Promise<PaginationResult<T>> {
    const page = options.page || 1;
    const pageSize = Math.min(options.pageSize || 10, 100);
    const offset = (page - 1) * pageSize;
    const where = options.where as any;

    const total = this.db.count(this.tableName, where);
    const data = this.db.findMany<T>(this.tableName, {
      where,
      orderBy: options.orderBy as any,
      limit: pageSize,
      offset,
    });

    return {
      data,
      total,
      page,
      pageSize,
      totalPages: Math.ceil(total / pageSize),
      hasNext: page * pageSize < total,
      hasPrev: page > 1,
    };
  }

  update(id: number, data: TUpdate): T {
    return this.db.updateById<T>(this.tableName, id, data as any, this.schema);
  }

  delete(id: number): boolean {
    return this.db.deleteById(this.tableName, id);
  }

  count(where?: Partial<T>): number {
    return this.db.count(this.tableName, where as any);
  }
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第五部分：具体的 Repository 实现
// ------------------------------------------------------------

class UserRepository extends Repository<UserRow, UserInsert, UserUpdate> {
  constructor(db: InMemoryDatabase) {
    super(db, 'users', {
      id: { type: 'number', primaryKey: true, autoIncrement: true },
      email: { type: 'string', unique: true },
      name: { type: 'string', nullable: true },
      age: { type: 'number', nullable: true },
      role: { type: 'string', defaultValue: 'user' },
      createdAt: { type: 'date', defaultValue: () => new Date() },
      updatedAt: { type: 'date', defaultValue: () => new Date() },
    });
  }

  findByEmail(email: string): UserRow | null {
    return this.findOne({ email } as Partial<UserRow>);
  }

  findAdults(): UserRow[] {
    return this.findMany({
      where: { age: { $gte: 18 } } as any,
      orderBy: { field: 'age', direction: 'asc' },
    });
  }
}

class PostRepository extends Repository<PostRow, PostInsert, PostUpdate> {
  constructor(db: InMemoryDatabase) {
    super(db, 'posts', {
      id: { type: 'number', primaryKey: true, autoIncrement: true },
      title: { type: 'string' },
      content: { type: 'string', nullable: true },
      published: { type: 'boolean', defaultValue: false },
      authorId: { type: 'number' },
      viewCount: { type: 'number', defaultValue: 0 },
      createdAt: { type: 'date', defaultValue: () => new Date() },
    });
  }

  findByAuthor(authorId: number): PostRow[] {
    return this.findMany({
      where: { authorId } as Partial<PostRow>,
      orderBy: { field: 'createdAt', direction: 'desc' },
    });
  }

  findPublished(options?: { page?: number; pageSize?: number }) {
    return this.paginate({
      where: { published: true } as Partial<PostRow>,
      orderBy: { field: 'createdAt', direction: 'desc' },
      page: options?.page,
      pageSize: options?.pageSize,
    });
  }

  publish(id: number): PostRow {
    return this.update(id, { published: true } as PostUpdate);
  }

  incrementViews(id: number): PostRow {
    const post = this.findById(id);
    if (!post) throw new NotFoundError('posts', id);
    return this.update(id, { viewCount: (post.viewCount || 0) + 1 } as PostUpdate);
  }
}

class CommentRepository extends Repository<CommentRow, CommentInsert, {}> {
  constructor(db: InMemoryDatabase) {
    super(db, 'comments', {
      id: { type: 'number', primaryKey: true, autoIncrement: true },
      postId: { type: 'number' },
      authorId: { type: 'number' },
      content: { type: 'string' },
      createdAt: { type: 'date', defaultValue: () => new Date() },
    });
  }

  findByPost(postId: number): CommentRow[] {
    return this.findMany({
      where: { postId } as Partial<CommentRow>,
      orderBy: { field: 'createdAt', direction: 'asc' },
    });
  }
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第六部分：类型安全的 SQL 模板标签
// ------------------------------------------------------------

interface SqlFragment {
  text: string;
  values: any[];
}

function sql(strings: TemplateStringsArray, ...values: any[]): SqlFragment {
  const parts: string[] = [];
  let paramIndex = 1;
  const processedValues: any[] = [];

  for (let i = 0; i < strings.length; i++) {
    parts.push(strings[i]);
    if (i < values.length) {
      if (values[i] && typeof values[i] === 'object' && 'text' in values[i] && 'values' in values[i]) {
        const nested = values[i] as SqlFragment;
        parts.push(nested.text);
        processedValues.push(...nested.values);
        paramIndex += nested.values.length;
      } else {
        parts.push(\`$\${paramIndex}\`);
        processedValues.push(values[i]);
        paramIndex++;
      }
    }
  }

  return { text: parts.join(''), values: processedValues };
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第七部分：数据库初始化和演示
// ------------------------------------------------------------

console.log('========================================');
console.log('  类型安全数据库层演示');
console.log('========================================\\n');

const db = new InMemoryDatabase();

const userRepo = new UserRepository(db);
const postRepo = new PostRepository(db);
const commentRepo = new CommentRepository(db);

// 监听数据库事件
db.on('record:insert', (event) => {
  console.log(\`  [DB事件] 插入 \${event.table}: id=\${event.record.id}\`);
});
db.on('record:update', (event) => {
  console.log(\`  [DB事件] 更新 \${event.table}: id=\${event.record.id}\`);
});
db.on('record:delete', (event) => {
  console.log(\`  [DB事件] 删除 \${event.table}: id=\${event.id}\`);
});

// 插入示例数据
console.log('\\n--- 1. 创建用户 ---');
const user1 = userRepo.create({
  email: 'alice@example.com',
  name: 'Alice',
  age: 28,
});
console.log('创建的用户:', user1);

const user2 = userRepo.create({
  email: 'bob@example.com',
  name: 'Bob',
  age: 17,
  role: 'admin',
});
console.log('创建的管理员:', user2);

const user3 = userRepo.create({
  email: 'charlie@example.com',
  age: 35,
});
console.log('创建的用户(name为null):', user3);

console.log('\\n--- 2. 测试唯一约束 ---');
try {
  userRepo.create({ email: 'alice@example.com', name: 'Duplicate' });
} catch (e: any) {
  console.log('捕获到错误:', e.message);
}

console.log('\\n--- 3. 创建文章 ---');
const post1 = postRepo.create({
  title: 'TypeScript 类型体操指南',
  content: 'TypeScript 的类型系统非常强大...',
  authorId: user1.id,
});
console.log('创建的文章:', post1);

const post2 = postRepo.create({
  title: 'Node.js 性能优化',
  content: 'Node.js 应用的性能优化策略...',
  authorId: user1.id,
  published: true,
});
console.log('创建的已发布文章:', post2);

const post3 = postRepo.create({
  title: 'Koa vs Express',
  content: '两个框架的对比分析...',
  authorId: user2.id,
});
console.log('创建的草稿文章:', post3);

console.log('\\n--- 4. 创建评论 ---');
const comment1 = commentRepo.create({
  postId: post2.id,
  authorId: user2.id,
  content: '写得很好！',
});
console.log('创建的评论:', comment1);

const comment2 = commentRepo.create({
  postId: post2.id,
  authorId: user3.id,
  content: '学到了很多，感谢分享！',
});
console.log('创建的评论:', comment2);

console.log('\\n--- 5. 查询所有用户 ---');
const allUsers = userRepo.findMany({
  orderBy: { field: 'createdAt', direction: 'asc' },
});
console.log(\`共 \${allUsers.length} 个用户:\`);
allUsers.forEach(u => {
  console.log(\`  #\${u.id} \${u.email} (\${u.name || '未命名'}, \${u.age || '年龄未知'}岁, 角色: \${u.role})\`);
});

console.log('\\n--- 6. 查询成年人用户（年龄 >= 18）---');
const adults = userRepo.findAdults();
console.log(\`成年人用户 (\${adults.length} 人):\`);
adults.forEach(u => console.log(\`  - \${u.name} (\${u.age}岁)\`));

console.log('\\n--- 7. 分页查询已发布文章 ---');
const publishedResult = await postRepo.findPublished({ page: 1, pageSize: 10 });
console.log(\`已发布文章分页 (第\${publishedResult.page}页, 共\${publishedResult.totalPages}页):\`);
publishedResult.data.forEach(p => {
  console.log(\`  #\${p.id} [\${p.published ? '已发布' : '草稿'}] \${p.title} - 阅读量: \${p.viewCount}\`);
});
console.log(\`分页信息: 总\${publishedResult.total}条, 有下一页: \${publishedResult.hasNext}, 有上一页: \${publishedResult.hasPrev}\`);

console.log('\\n--- 8. 根据作者查询文章 ---');
const alicePosts = postRepo.findByAuthor(user1.id);
console.log(\`Alice 的文章 (\${alicePosts.length} 篇):\`);
alicePosts.forEach(p => console.log(\`  - \${p.title}\`));

console.log('\\n--- 9. 查询文章评论 ---');
const postComments = commentRepo.findByPost(post2.id);
console.log(\`文章《\${post2.title}》的评论 (\${postComments.length} 条):\`);
postComments.forEach(c => {
  const author = userRepo.findById(c.authorId);
  console.log(\`  \${author?.name || '匿名'}: \${c.content}\`);
});

console.log('\\n--- 10. 更新文章：发布草稿并增加阅读量 ---');
const updatedPost = postRepo.publish(post3.id);
console.log('发布后的文章:', { id: updatedPost.id, title: updatedPost.title, published: updatedPost.published });

postRepo.incrementViews(post2.id);
postRepo.incrementViews(post2.id);
postRepo.incrementViews(post2.id);
const postAfterViews = postRepo.findById(post2.id);
console.log(\`阅读量增加后: \${postAfterViews?.viewCount} 次\`);

console.log('\\n--- 11. SQL 模板标签演示 ---');
const userId = 1;
const publishedOnly = true;
const query = sql\`SELECT p.*, u.name as author_name FROM posts p
  JOIN users u ON p.author_id = u.id
  WHERE p.author_id = \${userId}
  \${publishedOnly ? sql\`AND p.published = true\` : sql\`\`}
  ORDER BY p.created_at DESC\`;
console.log('生成的 SQL:');
console.log(query.text);
console.log('参数值:', query.values);

console.log('\\n--- 12. 事务演示 ---');
try {
  db.beginTransaction();
  const tempUser = userRepo.create({ email: 'temp@example.com', name: '临时用户' });
  console.log('事务中创建用户:', tempUser.email);
  console.log('事务中的用户总数:', userRepo.count());
  db.rollback();
  console.log('回滚后的用户总数:', userRepo.count());
} catch (e: any) {
  console.log('事务错误:', e.message);
}

console.log('\\n--- 13. 成功提交的事务 ---');
db.beginTransaction();
const committedUser = userRepo.create({ email: 'david@example.com', name: 'David', age: 42 });
console.log('事务中创建用户:', committedUser.email);
db.commit();
console.log('提交后的用户总数:', userRepo.count());
const foundDavid = userRepo.findByEmail('david@example.com');
console.log('David 存在:', foundDavid !== null);

console.log('\\n--- 14. 删除数据 ---');
console.log('删除前文章数:', postRepo.count());
postRepo.delete(post1.id);
console.log('删除后文章数:', postRepo.count());

try {
  postRepo.delete(999);
} catch (e: any) {
  console.log('删除不存在的记录:', e.message);
}

console.log('\\n--- 15. 更新用户信息 ---');
const updated = userRepo.update(user3.id, { name: 'Charlie Brown', age: 36 });
console.log('更新后的用户:', { id: updated.id, name: updated.name, age: updated.age });

console.log('\\n========================================');
console.log('  数据库层类型安全演示完成！');
console.log('========================================');
`,
  },

  // =========================================================
  // 第三章：认证与授权类型
  // =========================================================
  {
    id: "ts3-node-auth-security",
    title: "认证与授权类型",
    icon: "🔐",
    group: "Node.js 后端开发",
    content: `## 认证与授权类型：构建安全的类型化权限系统

### 认证（Authentication）vs 授权（Authorization）

在深入类型安全之前，我们必须清晰地区分两个常被混淆的概念：

- **认证（Authentication, AuthN）**：验证"你是谁"。这是登录过程——用户提供凭证（密码、Token、生物特征等），系统验证这些凭证是否有效，然后建立用户身份。
- **授权（Authorization, AuthZ）**：决定"你能做什么"。这是权限检查过程——即使你已登录，你是否有权访问某个资源、执行某个操作？

这两个环节都需要类型安全。一个类型不安全的认证系统可能导致：用户身份对象在代码中被错误地修改、Token 解析后的类型与实际不匹配、权限检查遗漏。而类型不安全的授权系统则可能导致：权限提升漏洞（普通用户获得管理员权限）、角色和权限的关系在代码中混乱、难以审计谁有什么权限。

### JWT（JSON Web Token）的类型安全

JWT 是现代 Web 应用中最常用的认证机制之一。一个 JWT 由三部分组成：Header、Payload、Signature。类型安全涉及 Payload 的结构：

\`\`\`ts
interface JwtHeader {
  alg: 'HS256' | 'RS256' | 'ES256';
  typ: 'JWT';
}

interface JwtPayload {
  sub: string;           // Subject (用户ID)
  iat: number;           // Issued At (签发时间)
  exp: number;           // Expiration Time (过期时间)
  iss?: string;          // Issuer (签发者)
  aud?: string;          // Audience (受众)
  // 自定义 Claims
  email?: string;
  role?: string;
  permissions?: string[];
}
\`\`\`

类型安全的 JWT 处理应该：
1. 解码后验证 Payload 的结构（不仅是签名，还有字段类型）
2. 区分"访问令牌（Access Token）"和"刷新令牌（Refresh Token）"的不同类型
3. 对过期时间进行类型安全的检查
4. 使用 branded type 或 nominal typing 防止将普通字符串误认为 Token

### Session 类型

虽然 JWT 流行，但基于 Session 的认证在很多场景下仍然适用。Session 的类型安全包括：

\`\`\`ts
interface SessionData {
  userId: number;
  createdAt: Date;
  lastActive: Date;
  data: Record<string, unknown>;
}

// Session ID 使用 branded type 防止与普通字符串混淆
type SessionId = string & { readonly __brand: 'SessionId' };
\`\`\`

Session 存储（Redis、内存、数据库）也应该是类型安全的——检索 Session 时应返回正确的类型，而非 \`any\`。

### 基于角色的访问控制（RBAC）类型

RBAC 是最常见的授权模型。核心概念：
- **用户（User）**：系统的使用者
- **角色（Role）**：权限的集合，如 "admin"、"editor"、"viewer"
- **权限（Permission）**：对特定资源的特定操作，如 "posts:read"、"posts:write"、"users:delete"

类型安全的 RBAC 系统应该：
1. 使用字符串字面量类型或枚举定义所有角色和权限，防止拼写错误
2. 在类型层面强制角色和权限的关系（例如，admin 自动拥有所有权限）
3. 权限检查函数接受类型化的权限标识，而非任意字符串
4. 支持资源作用域（例如，"你只能编辑自己的文章"）

### 基于属性的访问控制（ABAC）

RBAC 对于简单场景足够，但当权限规则变得复杂时（如"工作时间内部门经理可以审批本部门金额低于1万元的报销单"），需要 ABAC。ABAC 使用属性（用户属性、资源属性、环境属性）来决定授权。类型安全在 ABAC 中体现为：
- 属性字典的类型定义
- 策略表达式的类型安全
- 策略评估结果的类型化

### OAuth 2.0 和 OpenID Connect 的类型

OAuth 2.0 是授权框架，OpenID Connect 在其之上添加了身份层。涉及的类型包括：
- 授权码（Authorization Code）
- 访问令牌响应（Token Response）
- 令牌 introspection 响应
- UserInfo 响应
- 各种授权类型（Authorization Code, Client Credentials, Refresh Token 等）

每个 OAuth 流程中的请求和响应都应该有明确的类型定义，防止将授权码误认为访问令牌之类的错误。

### API Key 认证类型

服务间通信常用 API Key 认证。类型安全考量：
- API Key 的作用域（Scopes）类型
- Key 元数据（创建时间、过期时间、所属服务）
- Key 权限的细粒度控制

### 类型安全的 Auth 中间件

回到 Web 框架层面，认证中间件应该：
- 接收一个类型化的"未认证请求"
- 返回一个扩展了身份信息的"已认证请求"类型
- 认证失败时抛出类型化的错误
- 支持配置所需的角色或权限

这可以通过泛型实现——中间件变换请求类型，添加用户属性。

### 密码安全：类型层面的防御

密码处理是安全的核心。类型系统虽然不能直接防止密码泄露，但可以：
- 使用 branded type 区分"明文密码"和"哈希后密码"，防止将哈希值当作明文比较，反之亦然
- 强制密码策略（最小长度、复杂度）通过 branded type 或 branded type 的工厂函数
- 确保只有专门的密码验证函数可以比较密码

\`\`\`ts
type PlainPassword = string & { readonly __brand: 'PlainPassword' };
type HashedPassword = string & { readonly __brand: 'HashedPassword' };

function hashPassword(plain: PlainPassword): HashedPassword {
  // 使用 bcrypt/argon2 哈希
}

function verifyPassword(plain: PlainPassword, hashed: HashedPassword): boolean {
  // 验证
}
\`\`\`

### 多因素认证（MFA）类型

现代系统越来越多地使用 MFA。MFA 的状态机（未启用 → 启用中 → 已启用 → 验证中 → 已验证）可以用 TypeScript 的判别联合类型（Discriminated Unions）精确建模，防止非法状态转换。

### 本章代码示例

在本章的代码中，我们将使用 Node.js 内置的 \`crypto\` 模块构建一个类型安全的认证授权系统，包括：
- Branded types 区分 Token、密码哈希、Session ID
- JWT 的签发和验证（使用 HMAC SHA-256 实现简化版）
- 类型安全的密码哈希（使用 crypto.pbkdf2）
- 角色和权限系统的类型定义
- 基于角色和权限的授权检查
- Session 管理
- API Key 认证
- 模拟认证中间件
- 一个演示安全策略执行的完整流程
`,
    code: `// ============================================================
// 类型安全的认证与授权系统
// 使用 Node.js crypto 模块实现 JWT、密码哈希、RBAC
// ============================================================

import crypto from 'crypto';
import { EventEmitter } from 'events';

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第一部分：Branded Types（标称类型）
// ------------------------------------------------------------

type Brand<T, B> = T & { readonly __brand: B };

type UserId = Brand<number, 'UserId'>;
type SessionId = Brand<string, 'SessionId'>;
type AccessToken = Brand<string, 'AccessToken'>;
type RefreshToken = Brand<string, 'RefreshToken'>;
type ApiKey = Brand<string, 'ApiKey'>;
type PlainPassword = Brand<string, 'PlainPassword'>;
type HashedPassword = Brand<string, 'HashedPassword'>;
type PasswordSalt = Brand<string, 'PasswordSalt'>;

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第二部分：核心领域类型
// ------------------------------------------------------------

type Role = 'super_admin' | 'admin' | 'editor' | 'author' | 'viewer';

type Permission =
  | 'users:read'
  | 'users:write'
  | 'users:delete'
  | 'posts:read'
  | 'posts:write'
  | 'posts:delete'
  | 'posts:publish'
  | 'comments:read'
  | 'comments:write'
  | 'comments:delete'
  | 'settings:read'
  | 'settings:write'
  | 'analytics:read';

interface User {
  id: UserId;
  email: string;
  name: string;
  hashedPassword: HashedPassword;
  passwordSalt: PasswordSalt;
  role: Role;
  isActive: boolean;
  createdAt: Date;
  lastLoginAt?: Date;
  mfaEnabled: boolean;
  mfaSecret?: string;
}

interface Session {
  id: SessionId;
  userId: UserId;
  createdAt: Date;
  expiresAt: Date;
  ipAddress?: string;
  userAgent?: string;
  isRevoked: boolean;
}

interface TokenPair {
  accessToken: AccessToken;
  refreshToken: RefreshToken;
  accessTokenExpiresAt: Date;
  refreshTokenExpiresAt: Date;
}

interface JwtPayload {
  sub: string;
  iat: number;
  exp: number;
  type: 'access' | 'refresh';
  userId: number;
  email: string;
  role: Role;
  permissions: Permission[];
}

interface ApiKeyRecord {
  key: ApiKey;
  userId: UserId;
  name: string;
  scopes: Permission[];
  createdAt: Date;
  expiresAt?: Date;
  lastUsedAt?: Date;
  isRevoked: boolean;
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第三部分：RBAC 权限矩阵
// ------------------------------------------------------------

const rolePermissions: Record<Role, Permission[]> = {
  super_admin: [
    'users:read', 'users:write', 'users:delete',
    'posts:read', 'posts:write', 'posts:delete', 'posts:publish',
    'comments:read', 'comments:write', 'comments:delete',
    'settings:read', 'settings:write',
    'analytics:read',
  ],
  admin: [
    'users:read', 'users:write',
    'posts:read', 'posts:write', 'posts:delete', 'posts:publish',
    'comments:read', 'comments:write', 'comments:delete',
    'settings:read',
    'analytics:read',
  ],
  editor: [
    'posts:read', 'posts:write', 'posts:delete', 'posts:publish',
    'comments:read', 'comments:write', 'comments:delete',
    'analytics:read',
  ],
  author: [
    'posts:read', 'posts:write',
    'comments:read', 'comments:write',
  ],
  viewer: [
    'posts:read',
    'comments:read',
  ],
};

function getPermissionsForRole(role: Role): Permission[] {
  return [...rolePermissions[role]];
}

function hasPermission(userRole: Role, permission: Permission): boolean {
  return rolePermissions[userRole].includes(permission);
}

function hasAnyPermission(userRole: Role, permissions: Permission[]): boolean {
  return permissions.some(p => hasPermission(userRole, p));
}

function hasAllPermissions(userRole: Role, permissions: Permission[]): boolean {
  return permissions.every(p => hasPermission(userRole, p));
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第四部分：密码处理（使用 PBKDF2 + crypto）
// ------------------------------------------------------------

const PBKDF2_ITERATIONS = 100000;
const PBKDF2_KEYLEN = 64;
const PBKDF2_DIGEST = 'sha512';
const SALT_LENGTH = 32;

class PasswordPolicyError extends Error {
  constructor(message: string) {
    super(message);
    this.name = 'PasswordPolicyError';
  }
}

function validatePasswordStrength(password: string): asserts password is PlainPassword {
  if (password.length < 8) {
    throw new PasswordPolicyError('密码长度至少8个字符');
  }
  if (!/[A-Z]/.test(password)) {
    throw new PasswordPolicyError('密码必须包含至少一个大写字母');
  }
  if (!/[a-z]/.test(password)) {
    throw new PasswordPolicyError('密码必须包含至少一个小写字母');
  }
  if (!/[0-9]/.test(password)) {
    throw new PasswordPolicyError('密码必须包含至少一个数字');
  }
}

function generateSalt(): PasswordSalt {
  return crypto.randomBytes(SALT_LENGTH).toString('hex') as PasswordSalt;
}

function hashPassword(plainPassword: PlainPassword, salt: PasswordSalt): HashedPassword {
  const hash = crypto.pbkdf2Sync(
    plainPassword,
    salt,
    PBKDF2_ITERATIONS,
    PBKDF2_KEYLEN,
    PBKDF2_DIGEST
  );
  return hash.toString('hex') as HashedPassword;
}

function createHashedPassword(plainPassword: string): { hash: HashedPassword; salt: PasswordSalt } {
  validatePasswordStrength(plainPassword);
  const salt = generateSalt();
  const hash = hashPassword(plainPassword as PlainPassword, salt);
  return { hash, salt };
}

function verifyPassword(plainPassword: PlainPassword, hash: HashedPassword, salt: PasswordSalt): boolean {
  const computedHash = hashPassword(plainPassword, salt);
  return crypto.timingSafeEqual(
    Buffer.from(computedHash as string, 'hex'),
    Buffer.from(hash as string, 'hex')
  );
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第五部分：JWT 服务（简化版 HMAC-SHA256 实现）
// ------------------------------------------------------------

const JWT_SECRET = process.env.JWT_SECRET || 'development-secret-key-change-in-production';
const ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRY = 15 * 60 * 1000;
const REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRY = 7 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;

function base64UrlEncode(data: Buffer | string): string {
  const buf = typeof data === 'string' ? Buffer.from(data) : data;
  return buf.toString('base64url');
}

function base64UrlDecode(data: string): Buffer {
  return Buffer.from(data, 'base64url');
}

function signJwt(payload: Omit<JwtPayload, 'iat' | 'exp'>, expiresInMs: number, type: 'access' | 'refresh'): string {
  const header = { alg: 'HS256', typ: 'JWT' };
  const now = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);
  const fullPayload: JwtPayload = {
    ...payload,
    iat: now,
    exp: now + Math.floor(expiresInMs / 1000),
    type,
  };

  const encodedHeader = base64UrlEncode(JSON.stringify(header));
  const encodedPayload = base64UrlEncode(JSON.stringify(fullPayload));
  const signingInput = \`\${encodedHeader}.\${encodedPayload}\`;

  const signature = crypto
    .createHmac('sha256', JWT_SECRET)
    .update(signingInput)
    .digest('base64url');

  return \`\${signingInput}.\${signature}\`;
}

function verifyJwt(token: string): JwtPayload {
  const parts = token.split('.');
  if (parts.length !== 3) {
    throw new Error('无效的 Token 格式');
  }

  const [encodedHeader, encodedPayload, signature] = parts;
  const signingInput = \`\${encodedHeader}.\${encodedPayload}\`;

  const expectedSignature = crypto
    .createHmac('sha256', JWT_SECRET)
    .update(signingInput)
    .digest('base64url');

  if (!crypto.timingSafeEqual(
    Buffer.from(signature),
    Buffer.from(expectedSignature)
  )) {
    throw new Error('Token 签名验证失败');
  }

  const payload = JSON.parse(base64UrlDecode(encodedPayload).toString()) as JwtPayload;

  const now = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);
  if (payload.exp < now) {
    throw new Error('Token 已过期');
  }

  return payload;
}

function createTokenPair(user: User): TokenPair {
  const permissions = getPermissionsForRole(user.role);
  const now = new Date();

  const accessToken = signJwt(
    {
      sub: String(user.id),
      userId: user.id as number,
      email: user.email,
      role: user.role,
      permissions,
    },
    ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRY,
    'access'
  ) as AccessToken;

  const refreshToken = signJwt(
    {
      sub: String(user.id),
      userId: user.id as number,
      email: user.email,
      role: user.role,
      permissions: [],
    },
    REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRY,
    'refresh'
  ) as RefreshToken;

  return {
    accessToken,
    refreshToken,
    accessTokenExpiresAt: new Date(now.getTime() + ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRY),
    refreshTokenExpiresAt: new Date(now.getTime() + REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRY),
  };
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第六部分：认证服务
// ------------------------------------------------------------

class AuthError extends Error {
  constructor(message: string, public readonly code: string) {
    super(message);
    this.name = 'AuthError';
  }
}

class InvalidCredentialsError extends AuthError {
  constructor() {
    super('邮箱或密码错误', 'INVALID_CREDENTIALS');
    this.name = 'InvalidCredentialsError';
  }
}

class AccountDisabledError extends AuthError {
  constructor() {
    super('账户已被禁用', 'ACCOUNT_DISABLED');
    this.name = 'AccountDisabledError';
  }
}

class InsufficientPermissionsError extends AuthError {
  constructor(required: Permission | Permission[]) {
    const perms = Array.isArray(required) ? required.join(', ') : required;
    super(\`权限不足，需要: \${perms}\`, 'INSUFFICIENT_PERMISSIONS');
    this.name = 'InsufficientPermissionsError';
  }
}

class SessionExpiredError extends AuthError {
  constructor() {
    super('会话已过期', 'SESSION_EXPIRED');
    this.name = 'SessionExpiredError';
  }
}

interface AuthenticatedRequest {
  userId: UserId;
  user: User;
  session?: Session;
  tokenType: 'jwt' | 'session' | 'api_key';
  permissions: Permission[];
}

class AuthService extends EventEmitter {
  private users: Map<number, User> = new Map();
  private sessions: Map<string, Session> = new Map();
  private apiKeys: Map<string, ApiKeyRecord> = new Map();
  private refreshTokens: Set<string> = new Set();
  private nextUserId = 1;
  private sessionCleanupTimer?: NodeJS.Timeout;

  constructor() {
    super();
    this.setupCleanup();
  }

  private setupCleanup(): void {
    this.sessionCleanupTimer = setInterval(() => {
      const now = new Date();
      for (const [id, session] of this.sessions) {
        if (session.expiresAt < now || session.isRevoked) {
          this.sessions.delete(id);
        }
      }
    }, 60000) as unknown as NodeJS.Timeout;
  }

  registerUser(email: string, name: string, password: string, role: Role = 'viewer'): User {
    if ([...this.users.values()].some(u => u.email === email)) {
      throw new AuthError('邮箱已被注册', 'EMAIL_EXISTS');
    }
    const { hash, salt } = createHashedPassword(password);
    const user: User = {
      id: this.nextUserId++ as UserId,
      email,
      name,
      hashedPassword: hash,
      passwordSalt: salt,
      role,
      isActive: true,
      createdAt: new Date(),
      mfaEnabled: false,
    };
    this.users.set(user.id as number, user);
    this.emit('user:registered', { userId: user.id, email: user.email });
    return user;
  }

  loginWithPassword(email: string, password: string, ipAddress?: string, userAgent?: string): TokenPair {
    const user = [...this.users.values()].find(u => u.email === email);
    if (!user) {
      throw new InvalidCredentialsError();
    }
    if (!user.isActive) {
      throw new AccountDisabledError();
    }

    let isPasswordValid = false;
    try {
      validatePasswordStrength(password);
      isPasswordValid = verifyPassword(password as PlainPassword, user.hashedPassword, user.passwordSalt);
    } catch {
      isPasswordValid = false;
    }

    if (!isPasswordValid) {
      this.emit('auth:login_failed', { email, reason: 'invalid_password' });
      throw new InvalidCredentialsError();
    }

    user.lastLoginAt = new Date();
    const tokens = createTokenPair(user);

    this.refreshTokens.add(tokens.refreshToken as string);
    this.createSession(user.id, ipAddress, userAgent);

    this.emit('auth:login_success', { userId: user.id, email: user.email });
    return tokens;
  }

  createSession(userId: UserId, ipAddress?: string, userAgent?: string): Session {
    const sessionId = crypto.randomBytes(32).toString('hex') as SessionId;
    const now = new Date();
    const session: Session = {
      id: sessionId,
      userId,
      createdAt: now,
      expiresAt: new Date(now.getTime() + 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000),
      ipAddress,
      userAgent,
      isRevoked: false,
    };
    this.sessions.set(sessionId as string, session);
    return session;
  }

  authenticateWithToken(token: string): AuthenticatedRequest {
    const payload = verifyJwt(token);
    const user = this.users.get(payload.userId);
    if (!user || !user.isActive) {
      throw new AuthError('用户不存在或已禁用', 'INVALID_USER');
    }
    if (payload.type === 'refresh' && !this.refreshTokens.has(token)) {
      throw new AuthError('刷新令牌已被撤销', 'TOKEN_REVOKED');
    }
    return {
      userId: user.id,
      user,
      tokenType: 'jwt',
      permissions: payload.permissions.length > 0
        ? payload.permissions
        : getPermissionsForRole(user.role),
    };
  }

  authenticateWithSession(sessionId: string): AuthenticatedRequest {
    const session = this.sessions.get(sessionId);
    if (!session || session.isRevoked) {
      throw new SessionExpiredError();
    }
    if (session.expiresAt < new Date()) {
      this.sessions.delete(sessionId);
      throw new SessionExpiredError();
    }
    const user = this.users.get(session.userId as number);
    if (!user || !user.isActive) {
      throw new AuthError('用户不存在或已禁用', 'INVALID_USER');
    }
    session.lastActive = new Date();
    return {
      userId: user.id,
      user,
      session,
      tokenType: 'session',
      permissions: getPermissionsForRole(user.role),
    };
  }

  authenticateWithApiKey(apiKey: string): AuthenticatedRequest {
    const keyRecord = this.apiKeys.get(apiKey);
    if (!keyRecord || keyRecord.isRevoked) {
      throw new AuthError('无效的 API Key', 'INVALID_API_KEY');
    }
    if (keyRecord.expiresAt && keyRecord.expiresAt < new Date()) {
      throw new AuthError('API Key 已过期', 'API_KEY_EXPIRED');
    }
    const user = this.users.get(keyRecord.userId as number);
    if (!user || !user.isActive) {
      throw new AuthError('用户不存在或已禁用', 'INVALID_USER');
    }
    keyRecord.lastUsedAt = new Date();
    return {
      userId: user.id,
      user,
      tokenType: 'api_key',
      permissions: keyRecord.scopes,
    };
  }

  authorize(auth: AuthenticatedRequest, permission: Permission): void {
    if (!auth.permissions.includes(permission)) {
      throw new InsufficientPermissionsError(permission);
    }
  }

  authorizeAny(auth: AuthenticatedRequest, permissions: Permission[]): void {
    if (!hasAnyPermission(auth.user.role, permissions)) {
      const effective = auth.permissions;
      const hasOne = permissions.some(p => effective.includes(p));
      if (!hasOne) {
        throw new InsufficientPermissionsError(permissions);
      }
    }
  }

  authorizeAll(auth: AuthenticatedRequest, permissions: Permission[]): void {
    const effective = auth.permissions;
    if (!permissions.every(p => effective.includes(p))) {
      throw new InsufficientPermissionsError(permissions);
    }
  }

  createApiKey(userId: UserId, name: string, scopes: Permission[]): ApiKeyRecord {
    const user = this.users.get(userId as number);
    if (!user) throw new AuthError('用户不存在', 'USER_NOT_FOUND');

    for (const scope of scopes) {
      if (!hasPermission(user.role, scope)) {
        throw new AuthError(\`角色 \${user.role} 没有权限 \${scope}\`, 'INVALID_SCOPE');
      }
    }

    const keyValue = crypto.randomBytes(32).toString('hex') as ApiKey;
    const record: ApiKeyRecord = {
      key: keyValue,
      userId,
      name,
      scopes,
      createdAt: new Date(),
      isRevoked: false,
    };
    this.apiKeys.set(keyValue as string, record);
    return record;
  }

  revokeApiKey(apiKey: string): void {
    const record = this.apiKeys.get(apiKey);
    if (record) record.isRevoked = true;
  }

  revokeRefreshToken(token: string): void {
    this.refreshTokens.delete(token);
  }

  revokeSession(sessionId: string): void {
    const session = this.sessions.get(sessionId);
    if (session) session.isRevoked = true;
  }

  logout(accessToken: string): void {
    try {
      const payload = verifyJwt(accessToken);
      if (payload.type === 'refresh') {
        this.refreshTokens.delete(accessToken);
      }
    } catch {}
  }

  getUser(id: UserId): User | undefined {
    return this.users.get(id as number);
  }

  listUsers(): User[] {
    return [...this.users.values()];
  }
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第七部分：模拟请求上下文（用于演示中间件）
// ------------------------------------------------------------

interface MockContext {
  headers: Record<string, string>;
  cookies: Record<string, string>;
  auth?: AuthenticatedRequest;
}

// 类型安全的认证中间件
function requireAuth(authService: AuthService) {
  return (ctx: MockContext): void => {
    const authHeader = ctx.headers['authorization'];
    const sessionCookie = ctx.cookies['session_id'];
    const apiKeyHeader = ctx.headers['x-api-key'];

    if (authHeader?.startsWith('Bearer ')) {
      ctx.auth = authService.authenticateWithToken(authHeader.slice(7));
      return;
    }
    if (sessionCookie) {
      ctx.auth = authService.authenticateWithSession(sessionCookie);
      return;
    }
    if (apiKeyHeader) {
      ctx.auth = authService.authenticateWithApiKey(apiKeyHeader);
      return;
    }
    throw new AuthError('需要认证', 'AUTH_REQUIRED');
  };
}

// 类型安全的权限检查中间件工厂
function requirePermission(authService: AuthService, permission: Permission) {
  return (ctx: MockContext): void => {
    if (!ctx.auth) {
      throw new AuthError('需要认证', 'AUTH_REQUIRED');
    }
    authService.authorize(ctx.auth, permission);
  };
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第八部分：完整演示
// ------------------------------------------------------------

console.log('========================================');
console.log('  类型安全认证授权系统演示');
console.log('========================================\\n');

const authService = new AuthService();

authService.on('user:registered', (e: any) => {
  console.log(\`  [事件] 用户注册: \${e.email}\`);
});
authService.on('auth:login_success', (e: any) => {
  console.log(\`  [事件] 登录成功: userId=\${e.userId}\`);
});
authService.on('auth:login_failed', (e: any) => {
  console.log(\`  [事件] 登录失败: \${e.email} - \${e.reason}\`);
});

console.log('--- 1. 注册不同角色的用户 ---');
const superAdmin = authService.registerUser(
  'admin@example.com', '超级管理员', 'AdminPass123!', 'super_admin'
);
console.log('超级管理员:', { id: superAdmin.id, email: superAdmin.email, role: superAdmin.role });

const editor = authService.registerUser(
  'editor@example.com', '编辑张三', 'EditorPass456!', 'editor'
);
console.log('编辑:', { id: editor.id, email: editor.email, role: editor.role });

const author = authService.registerUser(
  'author@example.com', '作者李四', 'AuthorPass789!', 'author'
);
console.log('作者:', { id: author.id, email: author.email, role: author.role });

const viewer = authService.registerUser(
  'viewer@example.com', '读者王五', 'ViewerPass000!', 'viewer'
);
console.log('读者:', { id: viewer.id, email: viewer.email, role: viewer.role });

console.log('\\n--- 2. 测试密码策略 ---');
try {
  authService.registerUser('bad@example.com', 'Bad User', 'weak', 'viewer');
} catch (e: any) {
  console.log('弱密码被拒绝:', e.message);
}

try {
  authService.registerUser('bad2@example.com', 'Bad User', 'short1A!', 'viewer');
} catch (e: any) {
  console.log('短密码被拒绝:', e.message);
}

console.log('\\n--- 3. 测试重复邮箱注册 ---');
try {
  authService.registerUser('admin@example.com', 'Duplicate', 'Another123!', 'viewer');
} catch (e: any) {
  console.log('重复邮箱被拒绝:', e.message);
}

console.log('\\n--- 4. 登录并获取 Token ---');
const adminTokens = authService.loginWithPassword(
  'admin@example.com', 'AdminPass123!', '192.168.1.1', 'Mozilla/5.0'
);
console.log('管理员 Access Token (前50字符):', adminTokens.accessToken.slice(0, 50) + '...');
console.log('Access Token 过期时间:', adminTokens.accessTokenExpiresAt.toISOString());
console.log('Refresh Token 过期时间:', adminTokens.refreshTokenExpiresAt.toISOString());

const authorTokens = authService.loginWithPassword('author@example.com', 'AuthorPass789!');
const viewerTokens = authService.loginWithPassword('viewer@example.com', 'ViewerPass000!');

console.log('\\n--- 5. 测试密码错误登录 ---');
try {
  authService.loginWithPassword('admin@example.com', 'WrongPassword1!');
} catch (e: any) {
  console.log('错误密码登录结果:', e.message);
}

console.log('\\n--- 6. 用 JWT Token 认证 ---');
const adminCtx: MockContext = {
  headers: { 'authorization': \`Bearer \${adminTokens.accessToken}\` },
  cookies: {},
};
const authMiddleware = requireAuth(authService);
authMiddleware(adminCtx);
console.log('管理员认证成功:', {
  userId: adminCtx.auth!.userId,
  email: adminCtx.auth!.user.email,
  role: adminCtx.auth!.user.role,
  permissions: adminCtx.auth!.permissions.length + ' 个权限',
});

console.log('\\n--- 7. 测试权限检查 ---');
console.log('\\n管理员权限测试:');
const permChecks: Permission[] = ['users:delete', 'posts:write', 'settings:write', 'analytics:read'];
for (const perm of permChecks) {
  try {
    authService.authorize(adminCtx.auth!, perm);
    console.log(\`  ✓ \${perm}: 允许\`);
  } catch (e: any) {
    console.log(\`  ✗ \${perm}: \${e.message}\`);
  }
}

const authorCtx: MockContext = {
  headers: { 'authorization': \`Bearer \${authorTokens.accessToken}\` },
  cookies: {},
};
authMiddleware(authorCtx);

console.log('\\n作者权限测试:');
for (const perm of permChecks) {
  try {
    authService.authorize(authorCtx.auth!, perm);
    console.log(\`  ✓ \${perm}: 允许\`);
  } catch (e: any) {
    console.log(\`  ✗ \${perm}: \${e.message}\`);
  }
}

const viewerCtx: MockContext = {
  headers: { 'authorization': \`Bearer \${viewerTokens.accessToken}\` },
  cookies: {},
};
authMiddleware(viewerCtx);

console.log('\\n读者权限测试:');
for (const perm of [...permChecks, 'posts:read'] as Permission[]) {
  try {
    authService.authorize(viewerCtx.auth!, perm);
    console.log(\`  ✓ \${perm}: 允许\`);
  } catch (e: any) {
    console.log(\`  ✗ \${perm}: \${e.message}\`);
  }
}

console.log('\\n--- 8. 角色权限矩阵展示 ---');
const roles: Role[] = ['super_admin', 'admin', 'editor', 'author', 'viewer'];
const allPermissions: Permission[] = [
  'users:read', 'users:write', 'users:delete',
  'posts:read', 'posts:write', 'posts:delete', 'posts:publish',
];
console.log('权限矩阵 (✓=有权限):');
console.log('');
console.log('权限'.padEnd(18), ...roles.map(r => r.padEnd(12)));
console.log('-'.repeat(18 + roles.length * 12));
for (const perm of allPermissions) {
  const row = [perm.padEnd(18)];
  for (const role of roles) {
    row.push((hasPermission(role, perm) ? '✓' : '✗').padEnd(12));
  }
  console.log(row.join(''));
}

console.log('\\n--- 9. API Key 认证 ---');
const apiKeyRecord = authService.createApiKey(
  author.id, 'CI/CD 集成 Key', ['posts:read', 'posts:write']
);
console.log('创建的 API Key:', apiKeyRecord.key.slice(0, 20) + '...');
console.log('Key 权限:', apiKeyRecord.scopes);

const apiKeyCtx: MockContext = {
  headers: { 'x-api-key': apiKeyRecord.key as string },
  cookies: {},
};
authMiddleware(apiKeyCtx);
console.log('API Key 认证成功:', {
  userId: apiKeyCtx.auth!.userId,
  tokenType: apiKeyCtx.auth!.tokenType,
  permissions: apiKeyCtx.auth!.permissions,
});

console.log('\\nAPI Key 权限检查:');
try {
  authService.authorize(apiKeyCtx.auth!, 'posts:read');
  console.log('  ✓ posts:read: 允许');
} catch (e: any) {
  console.log(\`  ✗ posts:read: \${e.message}\`);
}
try {
  authService.authorize(apiKeyCtx.auth!, 'users:delete');
  console.log('  ✓ users:delete: 允许');
} catch (e: any) {
  console.log(\`  ✗ users:delete: \${e.message}\`);
}

console.log('\\n--- 10. Session 认证 ---');
const session = authService.createSession(editor.id, '10.0.0.1', 'Test Browser');
console.log('创建的 Session:', { id: (session.id as string).slice(0, 20) + '...', userId: session.userId });
const sessionCtx: MockContext = {
  headers: {},
  cookies: { 'session_id': session.id as string },
};
authMiddleware(sessionCtx);
console.log('Session 认证成功:', {
  userId: sessionCtx.auth!.userId,
  tokenType: sessionCtx.auth!.tokenType,
  email: sessionCtx.auth!.user.email,
});

console.log('\\n--- 11. 无认证信息的请求 ---');
const publicCtx: MockContext = { headers: {}, cookies: {} };
try {
  authMiddleware(publicCtx);
} catch (e: any) {
  console.log('未认证请求结果:', e.message, '(' + e.code + ')');
}

console.log('\\n--- 12. Token 篡改检测 ---');
try {
  const tamperedToken = adminTokens.accessToken.slice(0, -5) + 'xxxxx';
  authService.authenticateWithToken(tamperedToken);
} catch (e: any) {
  console.log('篡改的 Token 被拒绝:', e.message);
}

console.log('\\n--- 13. 用户列表 ---');
const allUsers = authService.listUsers();
console.log(\`共 \${allUsers.length} 个用户:\`);
allUsers.forEach(u => {
  console.log(\`  #\${u.id} \${u.email} - \${u.name} (\${u.role})\`);
});

console.log('\\n========================================');
console.log('  认证授权系统演示完成！');
console.log('========================================');
`,
