  // =========================================================
  // 第四章：事件驱动与流处理
  // =========================================================
  {
    id: "ts3-node-events-streams",
    title: "事件驱动与流处理",
    icon: "🌊",
    group: "Node.js 后端开发",
    content: `## 事件驱动与流处理：类型安全的异步数据流

### Node.js 的事件驱动基因

Node.js 的核心设计哲学之一就是事件驱动。从第一天起，Node.js 就围绕 \`EventEmitter\` 构建——HTTP 服务器在收到请求时触发 \`request\` 事件，文件流在数据到达时触发 \`data\` 事件，子进程在退出时触发 \`exit\` 事件。这种模式非常适合 I/O 密集型应用，因为它避免了为每个连接创建线程的开销。

然而，原生的 \`EventEmitter\` 在类型安全方面存在严重缺陷：

\`\`\`ts
// 原生 EventEmitter 的问题：
const emitter = new EventEmitter();
emitter.on('user_created', (user) => {
  // user 的类型是 any！你不知道它有什么属性
  console.log(user.email); // 如果 email 不存在，运行时才报错
});
emitter.emit('user_created', { naem: 'typo' }); // 拼写错误不会被发现
emitter.on('non_existent_event', () => {}); // 不存在的事件名也不会报错
\`\`\`

在大型系统中，这些问题会累积成维护噩梦：你无法通过搜索代码找到所有监听某个事件的地方（因为事件名是字符串字面量，没有类型约束），你无法可靠地知道某个事件携带什么数据，重构事件名或数据结构时编译器不会帮你找到所有需要修改的地方。

### 类型安全的 EventEmitter

解决这个问题的方法是使用**泛型事件映射（Generic Event Map）**。我们定义一个接口，将事件名映射到对应的回调函数类型，然后让类型化的 EventEmitter 只接受这些事件名，并自动推导回调参数的类型。

\`\`\`ts
interface DomainEvents {
  user_created: (user: User) => void;
  user_updated: (userId: number, changes: Partial<User>) => void;
  order_placed: (order: Order) => void;
  payment_received: (orderId: string, amount: number) => void;
  error: (error: Error) => void;
}

class TypedEventEmitter<TEvents extends Record<string, (...args: any[]) => void>> {
  on<K extends keyof TEvents>(event: K, listener: TEvents[K]): this;
  emit<K extends keyof TEvents>(event: K, ...args: Parameters<TEvents[K]>): boolean;
}
\`\`\`

这样做的好处：
1. **事件名类型检查**：\`emit('typo')\` 会编译报错
2. **参数类型推导**：\`on('user_created', (user) => ...)\` 中 user 自动获得 User 类型
3. **参数数量检查**：如果事件需要两个参数，emit 时必须传两个
4. **自动补全**：IDE 可以列出所有可用事件名
5. **重构安全**：重命名事件时编译器会标记所有需要修改的位置

### Pub/Sub（发布/订阅）模式

简单的 EventEmitter 是进程内的。当系统需要跨进程、跨服务通信时，需要 Pub/Sub 模式。类型安全在 Pub/Sub 中更加重要，因为发布者和订阅者可能在不同的代码库中（甚至不同的语言中，但在 TypeScript 单体或微服务中可以共享类型定义）。

一个类型安全的 Pub/Sub 系统应该：
- 每个 Topic 有明确的消息类型
- 发布时只能发布该 Topic 对应的消息类型
- 订阅时回调接收正确类型的消息
- 支持通配符订阅（可选，但需要谨慎处理类型）

### 消息队列类型

消息队列（如 RabbitMQ、Kafka、BullMQ）引入了更多概念：
- **消息（Message）**：包含 payload、headers、messageId、timestamp
- **队列（Queue）**：消息的缓冲区，有名称和类型参数
- **生产者（Producer）**：向队列发送类型化消息
- **消费者（Consumer）**：从队列接收类型化消息
- **死信队列（DLQ）**：处理失败消息的队列

类型系统应该确保生产者和消费者使用相同的消息类型。

### Node.js Stream 的类型

Node.js 的 Stream 模块是处理流式数据的核心。Stream 有四种类型：
- **Readable**：可读流（数据源），如 HTTP 响应、文件读取
- **Writable**：可写流（数据目的地），如 HTTP 请求、文件写入
- **Duplex**：双工流（既可读又可写），如 TCP Socket
- **Transform**：转换流（在读写过程中修改数据），如压缩、加密

\`@types/node\` 提供了 Stream 的类型，但直接使用时往往需要手动指定 \`any\`。我们可以通过泛型创建类型安全的 Stream：

\`\`\`ts
import { Readable, Writable, Transform } from 'stream';

// 类型安全的可读流：产生 string 类型的数据
class StringReadable extends Readable {
  constructor(private data: string[]) { super({ objectMode: false }); }
  _read() { /* push data */ }
}

// 更好的方式：使用 objectMode 传输类型化对象
interface TypedReadable<T> extends Readable {
  on(event: 'data', listener: (chunk: T) => void): this;
  on(event: 'end', listener: () => void): this;
}
\`\`\`

### 事件溯源（Event Sourcing）模式

事件溯源是一种架构模式，其中系统状态的所有变更都被记录为一系列事件。而不是存储当前状态，我们存储导致当前状态的所有事件。类型安全在事件溯源中极其重要，因为：
- 每种事件类型都需要有明确的结构
- 事件处理器（投影）需要正确处理每种事件类型
- 事件版本化需要类型支持

判别联合类型（Discriminated Unions）非常适合事件溯源：

\`\`\`ts
type DomainEvent =
  | { type: 'user_created'; userId: number; email: string; timestamp: Date }
  | { type: 'user_email_changed'; userId: number; oldEmail: string; newEmail: string; timestamp: Date }
  | { type: 'user_deleted'; userId: number; timestamp: Date };

// 事件处理器可以通过 type 字段进行类型收窄
function applyEvent(state: UserState, event: DomainEvent): UserState {
  switch (event.type) {
    case 'user_created':
      return { ...state, id: event.userId, email: event.email };
    case 'user_email_changed':
      return { ...state, email: event.newEmail };
    case 'user_deleted':
      return { ...state, deleted: true };
  }
}
\`\`\`

### CQRS（命令查询职责分离）类型

CQRS 将系统的写操作（命令）和读操作（查询）分离。命令改变状态但不返回数据，查询返回数据但不改变状态。类型安全的 CQRS 定义：
- 每个命令是一个类型化对象，包含执行操作所需的所有数据
- 命令处理器接收特定类型的命令
- 查询也是类型化的，返回类型化的结果

\`\`\`ts
interface Command {
  type: string;
  timestamp: Date;
}

interface CreatePostCommand extends Command {
  type: 'create_post';
  authorId: number;
  title: string;
  content: string;
}

interface CommandHandler<TCommand extends Command> {
  handle(command: TCommand): Promise<void>;
}
\`\`\`

### 管道（Pipeline）和组合

流处理中的常见模式是将多个 Transform 流组合成管道。类型安全的管道组合确保前一个流的输出类型与后一个流的输入类型匹配。

### Backpressure（背压）处理

Node.js Stream 内置了背压处理——当消费者处理速度跟不上生产者时，\`write()\` 返回 false，生产者应该等待 \`drain\` 事件。类型系统虽然不能直接解决背压逻辑问题，但正确的类型定义可以确保你在正确的地方处理背压。

### 本章代码示例

在本章的代码中，我们将使用 Node.js 的 \`events\` 和 \`stream\` 模块构建：
1. 类型安全的 TypedEventEmitter
2. 类型安全的 Pub/Sub 消息总线
3. 使用判别联合类型的事件溯源系统
4. 类型安全的对象模式 Transform 流
5. 类型安全的 CQRS 命令/查询总线
6. 一个完整的订单处理流程示例，展示事件驱动架构
`,
    code: `// ============================================================
// 类型安全的事件驱动与流处理系统
// 使用 Node.js events 和 stream 模块
// ============================================================

import { EventEmitter } from 'events';
import { Readable, Writable, Transform, PassThrough, pipeline } from 'stream';

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第一部分：类型安全的 EventEmitter
// ------------------------------------------------------------

type EventMap = Record<string | symbol, (...args: any[]) => void>;

class TypedEventEmitter<TEvents extends EventMap> {
  private emitter = new EventEmitter();

  on<K extends keyof TEvents>(event: K, listener: TEvents[K]): this {
    this.emitter.on(event as string | symbol, listener as (...args: any[]) => void);
    return this;
  }

  once<K extends keyof TEvents>(event: K, listener: TEvents[K]): this {
    this.emitter.once(event as string | symbol, listener as (...args: any[]) => void);
    return this;
  }

  off<K extends keyof TEvents>(event: K, listener: TEvents[K]): this {
    this.emitter.off(event as string | symbol, listener as (...args: any[]) => void);
    return this;
  }

  emit<K extends keyof TEvents>(event: K, ...args: Parameters<TEvents[K]>): boolean {
    return this.emitter.emit(event as string | symbol, ...args);
  }

  listenerCount<K extends keyof TEvents>(event: K): number {
    return this.emitter.listenerCount(event as string | symbol);
  }

  removeAllListeners<K extends keyof TEvents>(event?: K): this {
    this.emitter.removeAllListeners(event as string | symbol | undefined);
    return this;
  }
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第二部分：订单系统事件定义
// ------------------------------------------------------------

type OrderStatus = 'pending' | 'paid' | 'shipped' | 'delivered' | 'cancelled' | 'refunded';

interface OrderItem {
  productId: string;
  productName: string;
  quantity: number;
  unitPrice: number;
}

interface Order {
  id: string;
  customerId: string;
  items: OrderItem[];
  status: OrderStatus;
  totalAmount: number;
  createdAt: Date;
  updatedAt: Date;
  shippingAddress?: string;
  paymentId?: string;
}

interface OrderEvents {
  order_created: (order: Order) => void;
  order_paid: (orderId: string, paymentId: string, amount: number) => void;
  order_shipped: (orderId: string, trackingNumber: string) => void;
  order_delivered: (orderId: string, deliveredAt: Date) => void;
  order_cancelled: (orderId: string, reason: string) => void;
  order_refunded: (orderId: string, amount: number, reason: string) => void;
  inventory_reserved: (orderId: string, items: OrderItem[]) => void;
  inventory_insufficient: (orderId: string, productId: string, requested: number, available: number) => void;
  payment_failed: (orderId: string, reason: string) => void;
  error: (error: Error, context?: Record<string, unknown>) => void;
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第三部分：Pub/Sub 消息总线
// ------------------------------------------------------------

interface PubSubMessage<T = unknown> {
  id: string;
  topic: string;
  payload: T;
  timestamp: Date;
  metadata: Record<string, string>;
}

type SubscriptionHandler<T> = (message: PubSubMessage<T>) => void | Promise<void>;

class TypedPubSub {
  private topics: Map<string, Set<SubscriptionHandler<any>>> = new Map();
  private history: PubSubMessage[] = [];
  private readonly maxHistory = 100;

  subscribe<T>(topic: string, handler: SubscriptionHandler<T>): () => void {
    if (!this.topics.has(topic)) {
      this.topics.set(topic, new Set());
    }
    const handlers = this.topics.get(topic)!;
    handlers.add(handler);
    console.log(\`  [PubSub] 订阅主题: \${topic}\`);

    return () => {
      handlers.delete(handler);
      console.log(\`  [PubSub] 取消订阅: \${topic}\`);
    };
  }

  publish<T>(topic: string, payload: T, metadata: Record<string, string> = {}): PubSubMessage<T> {
    const message: PubSubMessage<T> = {
      id: cryptoRandomId(),
      topic,
      payload,
      timestamp: new Date(),
      metadata,
    };
    this.history.push(message as PubSubMessage);
    if (this.history.length > this.maxHistory) {
      this.history.shift();
    }

    const handlers = this.topics.get(topic);
    if (handlers) {
      for (const handler of handlers) {
        try {
          const result = handler(message);
          if (result instanceof Promise) {
            result.catch(err => console.error(\`  [PubSub] 处理消息 \${topic} 出错:\`, err.message));
          }
        } catch (err: any) {
          console.error(\`  [PubSub] 处理消息 \${topic} 出错:\`, err.message);
        }
      }
    }

    console.log(\`  [PubSub] 发布消息到 \${topic}: \${JSON.stringify(payload).slice(0, 100)}\`);
    return message;
  }

  getTopicSubscriberCount(topic: string): number {
    return this.topics.get(topic)?.size || 0;
  }

  getHistory(topic?: string): PubSubMessage[] {
    if (topic) {
      return this.history.filter(m => m.topic === topic);
    }
    return [...this.history];
  }
}

function cryptoRandomId(): string {
  return Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 10) + Date.now().toString(36);
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第四部分：事件溯源系统
// ------------------------------------------------------------

type DomainEvent =
  | { type: 'order_created'; orderId: string; customerId: string; items: OrderItem[]; totalAmount: number; timestamp: Date }
  | { type: 'order_paid'; orderId: string; paymentId: string; amount: number; timestamp: Date }
  | { type: 'order_shipped'; orderId: string; trackingNumber: string; timestamp: Date }
  | { type: 'order_delivered'; orderId: string; deliveredAt: Date; timestamp: Date }
  | { type: 'order_cancelled'; orderId: string; reason: string; timestamp: Date }
  | { type: 'item_added'; orderId: string; item: OrderItem; timestamp: Date }
  | { type: 'item_removed'; orderId: string; productId: string; timestamp: Date };

interface OrderState {
  orderId: string;
  customerId: string;
  items: OrderItem[];
  status: OrderStatus;
  totalAmount: number;
  paidAmount: number;
  paymentId?: string;
  trackingNumber?: string;
  createdAt?: Date;
  deliveredAt?: Date;
  cancelledReason?: string;
  version: number;
}

function createInitialState(): OrderState {
  return {
    orderId: '',
    customerId: '',
    items: [],
    status: 'pending',
    totalAmount: 0,
    paidAmount: 0,
    version: 0,
  };
}

function applyEvent(state: OrderState, event: DomainEvent): OrderState {
  const newState = { ...state, version: state.version + 1 };

  switch (event.type) {
    case 'order_created':
      newState.orderId = event.orderId;
      newState.customerId = event.customerId;
      newState.items = [...event.items];
      newState.totalAmount = event.totalAmount;
      newState.status = 'pending';
      newState.createdAt = event.timestamp;
      break;
    case 'order_paid':
      newState.status = 'paid';
      newState.paidAmount = event.amount;
      newState.paymentId = event.paymentId;
      break;
    case 'order_shipped':
      newState.status = 'shipped';
      newState.trackingNumber = event.trackingNumber;
      break;
    case 'order_delivered':
      newState.status = 'delivered';
      newState.deliveredAt = event.deliveredAt;
      break;
    case 'order_cancelled':
      newState.status = 'cancelled';
      newState.cancelledReason = event.reason;
      break;
    case 'item_added':
      newState.items = [...state.items, event.item];
      newState.totalAmount = newState.items.reduce((sum, i) => sum + i.unitPrice * i.quantity, 0);
      break;
    case 'item_removed':
      newState.items = state.items.filter(i => i.productId !== event.productId);
      newState.totalAmount = newState.items.reduce((sum, i) => sum + i.unitPrice * i.quantity, 0);
      break;
  }

  return newState;
}

function replayEvents(events: DomainEvent[]): OrderState {
  return events.reduce((state, event) => applyEvent(state, event), createInitialState());
}

class EventStore extends TypedEventEmitter<{
  event_appended: (event: DomainEvent) => void;
  state_rebuilt: (orderId: string, state: OrderState) => void;
}> {
  private events: Map<string, DomainEvent[]> = new Map();
  private snapshots: Map<string, { state: OrderState; version: number }> = new Map();

  append(orderId: string, event: DomainEvent): void {
    if (!this.events.has(orderId)) {
      this.events.set(orderId, []);
    }
    this.events.get(orderId)!.push(event);
    this.emit('event_appended', event);
    console.log(\`  [EventStore] 存储事件: \${event.type} (订单 \${orderId}, 版本#\${this.events.get(orderId)!.length})\`);
  }

  getEvents(orderId: string): DomainEvent[] {
    return [...(this.events.get(orderId) || [])];
  }

  getCurrentState(orderId: string): OrderState {
    const snapshot = this.snapshots.get(orderId);
    let state: OrderState;
    let fromVersion = 0;

    if (snapshot) {
      state = { ...snapshot.state };
      fromVersion = snapshot.version;
    } else {
      state = createInitialState();
    }

    const events = this.getEvents(orderId);
    for (const event of events.slice(fromVersion)) {
      state = applyEvent(state, event);
    }

    return state;
  }

  createSnapshot(orderId: string): void {
    const state = this.getCurrentState(orderId);
    this.snapshots.set(orderId, { state, version: state.version });
    console.log(\`  [EventStore] 创建快照: 订单 \${orderId} @ v\${state.version}\`);
  }

  getAllOrderIds(): string[] {
    return [...this.events.keys()];
  }
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第五部分：CQRS 命令/查询总线
// ------------------------------------------------------------

interface CqrsCommand {
  type: string;
  timestamp: Date;
  correlationId?: string;
}

interface CqrsQuery<TResult = unknown> {
  type: string;
}

interface CreateOrderCommand extends CqrsCommand {
  type: 'create_order';
  customerId: string;
  items: OrderItem[];
}

interface PayOrderCommand extends CqrsCommand {
  type: 'pay_order';
  orderId: string;
  paymentId: string;
  amount: number;
}

interface CancelOrderCommand extends CqrsCommand {
  type: 'cancel_order';
  orderId: string;
  reason: string;
}

interface ShipOrderCommand extends CqrsCommand {
  type: 'ship_order';
  orderId: string;
  trackingNumber: string;
}

type AllCommands = CreateOrderCommand | PayOrderCommand | CancelOrderCommand | ShipOrderCommand;

interface GetOrderQuery extends CqrsQuery<OrderState> {
  type: 'get_order';
  orderId: string;
}

interface GetOrderHistoryQuery extends CqrsQuery<DomainEvent[]> {
  type: 'get_order_history';
  orderId: string;
}

interface ListOrdersQuery extends CqrsQuery<OrderState[]> {
  type: 'list_orders';
  customerId?: string;
  status?: OrderStatus;
}

class CqrsBus {
  private commandHandlers: Map<string, (cmd: any) => void | Promise<void>> = new Map();
  private queryHandlers: Map<string, (q: any) => any> = new Map();
  private eventStore: EventStore;

  constructor(eventStore: EventStore) {
    this.eventStore = eventStore;
    this.registerBuiltInHandlers();
  }

  private registerBuiltInHandlers(): void {
    this.registerCommandHandler<CreateOrderCommand>('create_order', (cmd) => {
      const orderId = cryptoRandomId();
      const totalAmount = cmd.items.reduce((sum, i) => sum + i.unitPrice * i.quantity, 0);
      this.eventStore.append(orderId, {
        type: 'order_created',
        orderId,
        customerId: cmd.customerId,
        items: cmd.items,
        totalAmount,
        timestamp: new Date(),
      });
    });

    this.registerCommandHandler<PayOrderCommand>('pay_order', (cmd) => {
      const state = this.eventStore.getCurrentState(cmd.orderId);
      if (state.status !== 'pending') {
        throw new Error(\`无法支付状态为 \${state.status} 的订单\`);
      }
      this.eventStore.append(cmd.orderId, {
        type: 'order_paid',
        orderId: cmd.orderId,
        paymentId: cmd.paymentId,
        amount: cmd.amount,
        timestamp: new Date(),
      });
    });

    this.registerCommandHandler<ShipOrderCommand>('ship_order', (cmd) => {
      const state = this.eventStore.getCurrentState(cmd.orderId);
      if (state.status !== 'paid') {
        throw new Error(`无法发货状态为 ${state.status} 的订单`);
      }
      this.eventStore.append(cmd.orderId, {
        type: 'order_shipped',
        orderId: cmd.orderId,
        trackingNumber: cmd.trackingNumber,
        timestamp: new Date(),
      });
    });

    this.registerCommandHandler<CancelOrderCommand>('cancel_order', (cmd) => {
      const state = this.eventStore.getCurrentState(cmd.orderId);
      if (state.status === 'delivered') {
        throw new Error('已送达的订单无法取消');
      }
      this.eventStore.append(cmd.orderId, {
        type: 'order_cancelled',
        orderId: cmd.orderId,
        reason: cmd.reason,
        timestamp: new Date(),
      });
    });

    this.registerQueryHandler<GetOrderQuery, OrderState>('get_order', (q) => {
      return this.eventStore.getCurrentState(q.orderId);
    });

    this.registerQueryHandler<GetOrderHistoryQuery, DomainEvent[]>('get_order_history', (q) => {
      return this.eventStore.getEvents(q.orderId);
    });

    this.registerQueryHandler<ListOrdersQuery, OrderState[]>('list_orders', (q) => {
      const orders: OrderState[] = [];
      for (const id of this.eventStore.getAllOrderIds()) {
        const state = this.eventStore.getCurrentState(id);
        if (q.customerId && state.customerId !== q.customerId) continue;
        if (q.status && state.status !== q.status) continue;
        orders.push(state);
      }
      return orders;
    });
  }

  private registerCommandHandler<T extends CqrsCommand>(
    type: T['type'],
    handler: (cmd: T) => void | Promise<void>
  ): void {
    this.commandHandlers.set(type, handler as (cmd: any) => void);
  }

  private registerQueryHandler<TQ extends CqrsQuery<TR>, TR>(
    type: TQ['type'],
    handler: (q: TQ) => TR
  ): void {
    this.queryHandlers.set(type, handler as (q: any) => any);
  }

  execute<T extends AllCommands>(command: T): void {
    const handler = this.commandHandlers.get(command.type);
    if (!handler) throw new Error(`未找到命令处理器: ${command.type}`);
    console.log(`  [CQRS] 执行命令: ${command.type}`);
    handler(command);
  }

  query<TResult>(query: CqrsQuery<TResult>): TResult {
    const handler = this.queryHandlers.get(query.type);
    if (!handler) throw new Error(`未找到查询处理器: ${query.type}`);
    return handler(query) as TResult;
  }
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第六部分：类型安全的 Stream 处理
// ------------------------------------------------------------

interface LogEntry {
  timestamp: Date;
  level: 'debug' | 'info' | 'warn' | 'error';
  service: string;
  message: string;
  metadata?: Record<string, unknown>;
}

class TypedReadable<T> extends Readable {
  private buffer: T[] = [];
  private ended = false;

  constructor(opts: { highWaterMark?: number } = {}) {
    super({ objectMode: true, highWaterMark: opts.highWaterMark || 16 });
  }

  pushData(chunk: T): void {
    this.buffer.push(chunk);
    this._read();
  }

  end(): void {
    this.ended = true;
    this._read();
  }

  _read(): void {
    while (this.buffer.length > 0) {
      const chunk = this.buffer.shift()!;
      if (!this.push(chunk)) break;
    }
    if (this.ended && this.buffer.length === 0) {
      this.push(null);
    }
  }
}

class TypedTransform<TIn, TOut> extends Transform {
  private transformFn: (chunk: TIn) => TOut | TOut[] | null;

  constructor(transformFn: (chunk: TIn) => TOut | TOut[] | null) {
    super({ objectMode: true });
    this.transformFn = transformFn;
  }

  _transform(chunk: TIn, _encoding: string, callback: (error?: Error | null, data?: any) => void): void {
    try {
      const result = this.transformFn(chunk);
      if (result === null) {
        callback();
      } else if (Array.isArray(result)) {
        for (const item of result) {
          this.push(item);
        }
        callback();
      } else {
        callback(null, result);
      }
    } catch (err: any) {
      callback(err);
    }
  }
}

class TypedWritable<T> extends Writable {
  private chunks: T[] = [];
  private writeFn?: (chunk: T) => void;

  constructor(writeFn?: (chunk: T) => void) {
    super({ objectMode: true });
    this.writeFn = writeFn;
  }

  _write(chunk: T, _encoding: string, callback: (error?: Error | null) => void): void {
    this.chunks.push(chunk);
    if (this.writeFn) {
      try {
        this.writeFn(chunk);
        callback();
      } catch (err: any) {
        callback(err);
      }
    } else {
      callback();
    }
  }

  getChunks(): T[] {
    return [...this.chunks];
  }
}

// 日志处理管道：解析 -> 过滤 -> 格式化 -> 聚合
function createLogPipeline() {
  const source = new TypedReadable<{ raw: string }>();
  const parser = new TypedTransform<{ raw: string }, LogEntry | null>(({ raw }) => {
    try {
      const parsed = JSON.parse(raw) as LogEntry;
      parsed.timestamp = new Date(parsed.timestamp);
      return parsed;
    } catch {
      return null;
    }
  });
  const errorFilter = new TypedTransform<LogEntry, LogEntry>((entry) => {
    if (entry.level === 'error' || entry.level === 'warn') return entry;
    return null;
  });
  const formatter = new TypedTransform<LogEntry, string>((entry) => {
    const meta = entry.metadata ? ` ${JSON.stringify(entry.metadata)}` : '';
    return `[${entry.timestamp.toISOString()}] [${entry.level.toUpperCase()}] [${entry.service}] ${entry.message}${meta}`;
  });
  const sink = new TypedWritable<string>((line) => {
    console.log(`    📋 ${line}`);
  });
  return { source, parser, errorFilter, formatter, sink };
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第七部分：完整演示
// ------------------------------------------------------------

console.log('========================================');
console.log('  类型安全事件驱动与流处理演示');
console.log('========================================\n');

// --- 演示 1: TypedEventEmitter ---
console.log('--- 1. 类型安全的事件总线（订单事件）---');

const orderEmitter = new TypedEventEmitter<OrderEvents>();

orderEmitter.on('order_created', (order) => {
  console.log(`  📦 订单创建: #${order.id}, 金额: ¥${order.totalAmount}, 客户: ${order.customerId}`);
});

orderEmitter.on('order_paid', (orderId, paymentId, amount) => {
  console.log(`  💰 订单支付: #${orderId}, 支付单号: ${paymentId}, 金额: ¥${amount}`);
});

orderEmitter.on('order_shipped', (orderId, trackingNumber) => {
  console.log(`  🚚 订单发货: #${orderId}, 运单号: ${trackingNumber}`);
});

orderEmitter.on('order_delivered', (orderId, deliveredAt) => {
  console.log(`  ✅ 订单送达: #${orderId}, 送达时间: ${deliveredAt.toISOString()}`);
});

orderEmitter.on('order_cancelled', (orderId, reason) => {
  console.log(`  ❌ 订单取消: #${orderId}, 原因: ${reason}`);
});

orderEmitter.on('error', (error, ctx) => {
  console.log(`  ⚠️  错误: ${error.message}`, ctx || '');
});

const testOrder: Order = {
  id: 'ORD-001',
  customerId: 'CUST-100',
  items: [
    { productId: 'P1', productName: 'TypeScript 书籍', quantity: 2, unitPrice: 99 },
    { productId: 'P2', productName: '机械键盘', quantity: 1, unitPrice: 599 },
  ],
  status: 'pending',
  totalAmount: 2 * 99 + 599,
  createdAt: new Date(),
  updatedAt: new Date(),
};

orderEmitter.emit('order_created', testOrder);
orderEmitter.emit('order_paid', testOrder.id, 'PAY-abc123', testOrder.totalAmount);
orderEmitter.emit('order_shipped', testOrder.id, 'SF-EXPRESS-789');
orderEmitter.emit('order_delivered', testOrder.id, new Date());

const testOrder2: Order = {
  ...testOrder,
  id: 'ORD-002',
  totalAmount: 199,
  items: [{ productId: 'P3', productName: '鼠标垫', quantity: 1, unitPrice: 199 }],
};

orderEmitter.emit('order_created', testOrder2);
orderEmitter.emit('order_cancelled', testOrder2.id, '用户主动取消');

// --- 演示 2: Pub/Sub ---
console.log('\n--- 2. Pub/Sub 消息总线 ---');

const bus = new TypedPubSub();

const unsubInventory = bus.subscribe<{ orderId: string; items: OrderItem[] }>('inventory.reserved', (msg) => {
  console.log(`  📥 库存服务收到消息: 订单 ${msg.payload.orderId} 预留库存完成`);
  msg.payload.items.forEach(i => console.log(`     - ${i.productName} x${i.quantity}`));
});

bus.subscribe<{ orderId: string }>('notification.email', (msg) => {
  console.log(`  📧 邮件服务: 向订单 ${msg.payload.orderId} 发送通知邮件`);
});

bus.subscribe<{ orderId: string }>('notification.sms', (msg) => {
  console.log(`  📱 短信服务: 向订单 ${msg.payload.orderId} 发送通知短信`);
});

bus.subscribe<{ orderId: string; amount: number }>('analytics.order', (msg) => {
  console.log(`  📊 分析服务: 记录订单统计 ¥${msg.payload.amount}`);
});

bus.publish('inventory.reserved', { orderId: 'ORD-001', items: testOrder.items });
bus.publish('notification.email', { orderId: 'ORD-001' });
bus.publish('notification.sms', { orderId: 'ORD-001' });
bus.publish('analytics.order', { orderId: 'ORD-001', amount: 797 });

console.log(`\n  主题订阅者数量: inventory.reserved = ${bus.getTopicSubscriberCount('inventory.reserved')}`);

unsubInventory();
console.log('  取消库存服务订阅后...');
console.log(`  主题订阅者数量: inventory.reserved = ${bus.getTopicSubscriberCount('inventory.reserved')}`);

// --- 演示 3: 事件溯源 ---
console.log('\n--- 3. 事件溯源（Event Sourcing）---');

const eventStore = new EventStore();
const cqrs = new CqrsBus(eventStore);

eventStore.on('event_appended', (event) => {
  console.log(`  📝 事件追加: ${event.type} (${event.orderId})`);
});

console.log('\n  通过 CQRS 命令创建订单:');
cqrs.execute({
  type: 'create_order',
  customerId: 'CUST-200',
  items: [
    { productId: 'P4', productName: '显示器', quantity: 1, unitPrice: 2999 },
    { productId: 'P5', productName: 'HDMI 线', quantity: 2, unitPrice: 49 },
  ],
  timestamp: new Date(),
  correlationId: 'CORR-001',
});

const ordersAfterCreate = cqrs.query<ListOrdersQuery, OrderState[]>({ type: 'list_orders' });
const newOrderId = ordersAfterCreate[0].orderId;
console.log(`  创建的订单 ID: ${newOrderId}`);
console.log(`  订单初始状态: ${ordersAfterCreate[0].status}, 金额: ¥${ordersAfterCreate[0].totalAmount}`);

console.log('\n  支付订单:');
cqrs.execute({
  type: 'pay_order',
  orderId: newOrderId,
  paymentId: 'PAY-def456',
  amount: ordersAfterCreate[0].totalAmount,
  timestamp: new Date(),
});

console.log('  发货订单:');
cqrs.execute({
  type: 'ship_order',
  orderId: newOrderId,
  trackingNumber: 'YT-EXPRESS-101',
  timestamp: new Date(),
});

const finalState = cqrs.query<GetOrderQuery, OrderState>({ type: 'get_order', orderId: newOrderId });
console.log(`\n  订单当前状态: ${finalState.status}`);
console.log(`  版本号: v${finalState.version}`);
console.log(`  商品列表: ${finalState.items.map(i => i.productName).join(', ')}`);

console.log('\n  创建快照前的事件数:', eventStore.getEvents(newOrderId).length);
eventStore.createSnapshot(newOrderId);

const history = cqrs.query<GetOrderHistoryQuery, DomainEvent[]>({ type: 'get_order_history', orderId: newOrderId });
console.log('  事件历史:');
history.forEach((e, i) => {
  console.log(`    ${i + 1}. ${e.type} @ ${e.timestamp.toISOString()}`);
});

console.log('\n  尝试取消已发货订单（应失败）:');
try {
  cqrs.execute({
    type: 'cancel_order',
    orderId: newOrderId,
    reason: '测试',
    timestamp: new Date(),
  });
} catch (e: any) {
  console.log(`  错误: ${e.message}`);
}

// --- 演示 4: 类型安全的 Streams ---
console.log('\n--- 4. 类型安全的流处理（日志管道）---');

const { source, parser, errorFilter, formatter, sink } = createLogPipeline();

console.log('  处理日志流（仅过滤 error/warn 级别）:');

const logLines = [
  JSON.stringify({ timestamp: new Date().toISOString(), level: 'info', service: 'api', message: '服务器启动' }),
  JSON.stringify({ timestamp: new Date().toISOString(), level: 'debug', service: 'db', message: '查询执行', metadata: { query: 'SELECT 1' } }),
  JSON.stringify({ timestamp: new Date().toISOString(), level: 'error', service: 'payment', message: '支付网关超时', metadata: { orderId: 'ORD-003' } }),
  JSON.stringify({ timestamp: new Date().toISOString(), level: 'warn', service: 'auth', message: '多次登录失败', metadata: { ip: '192.168.1.100' } }),
  JSON.stringify({ timestamp: new Date().toISOString(), level: 'info', service: 'cache', message: '缓存命中' }),
  JSON.stringify('invalid json line'),
  JSON.stringify({ timestamp: new Date().toISOString(), level: 'error', service: 'order', message: '库存不足', metadata: { productId: 'P6' } }),
];

pipeline(source, parser, errorFilter, formatter, sink, (err) => {
  if (err) console.error('  管道错误:', err.message);
});

for (const line of logLines) {
  source.pushData({ raw: line });
}
source.end();

// 等待流处理完成
await new Promise<void>((resolve) => {
  sink.on('finish', () => {
    console.log(`  共捕获 ${sink.getChunks().length} 条警告/错误日志`);
    resolve();
  });
});

console.log('\n========================================');
console.log('  事件驱动与流处理演示完成！');
console.log('========================================');
`,
  },

  // =========================================================
  // 第五章：CLI 工具开发
  // =========================================================
  {
    id: "ts3-node-cli-tooling",
    title: "CLI 工具开发",
    icon: "🛠️",
    group: "Node.js 后端开发",
    content: `## CLI 工具开发：类型安全的命令行界面

### 为什么 CLI 工具需要类型安全？

命令行界面（CLI）是开发者与系统交互的最古老也是最强大的方式之一。从 Git 到 Docker，从 npm 到 Webpack，从 TypeScript 编译器到 ESLint，几乎所有开发工具都提供 CLI。一个设计良好的 CLI 工具可以极大提升开发效率，而类型安全在 CLI 开发中扮演着至关重要的角色。

乍一看，CLI 工具似乎只是"解析字符串参数然后执行逻辑"，但实际上，一个健壮的 CLI 工具涉及复杂的类型挑战：

1. **参数解析的类型安全**：\`--port 3000\` 中的 3000 是数字还是字符串？\`--debug\` 是布尔标志还是接受值？\`--env production\` 是否限制在特定枚举值内？
2. **命令/子命令层次结构**：像 \`git commit -m "message"\`、\`docker run -d nginx\` 这样的子命令嵌套，每层都有自己的选项集合
3. **配置文件类型**：CLI 工具通常支持配置文件（.tsconfig.json, .eslintrc 等），配置文件内容需要类型验证
4. **插件系统类型**：可扩展的 CLI 工具（如 Vue CLI、Webpack CLI）支持插件，插件接口需要类型定义
5. **进度报告和输出**：进度条、彩色输出、结构化日志都需要类型化的 API
6. **交互式提示**：inquirer/prompts 之类的交互式输入也需要类型安全

### Commander.js 和 Yargs 的类型模式

在 Node.js 生态中，最流行的 CLI 框架是 Commander.js 和 Yargs。它们都提供了 TypeScript 类型支持，但类型安全程度不同：

**Commander.js** 采用链式 API 定义命令和选项：
\`\`\`ts
program
  .command('build')
  .description('构建项目')
  .option('-o, --output <dir>', '输出目录', './dist')
  .option('-m, --mode <mode>', '构建模式', 'production')
  .option('-w, --watch', '监听模式', false)
  .action((options) => {
    // options.output 是 string
    // options.mode 是 'development' | 'production' | 'test' (如果我们用泛型约束)
    // options.watch 是 boolean
  });
\`\`\`

**Yargs** 采用对象配置风格，有更强的类型推导能力：
\`\`\`ts
const argv = yargs
  .command('serve', '启动服务器', (yargs) => {
    return yargs
      .option('port', { type: 'number', default: 3000 })
      .option('host', { type: 'string', default: 'localhost' });
  })
  .help()
  .parseSync();
\`\`\`

然而，这些库的类型系统都是"事后"推导的——你在链式调用中定义选项，库推导结果类型。这有两个局限：
1. 类型推导依赖于库的复杂类型体操，可能出现类型不准确的情况
2. 难以将选项类型复用于其他地方（如配置文件、环境变量）

### 手动构建类型安全 CLI 框架的核心思路

与其依赖外部库的黑盒类型，我们可以理解 CLI 类型系统的核心原理：

1. **选项定义 → 选项类型的映射**：每个选项有类型（string/number/boolean/array）、默认值、是否必填、别名
2. **参数解析器**：将原始字符串数组转换为类型化的选项对象
3. **命令注册表**：每个命令有自己的选项定义和处理函数
4. **子命令嵌套**：命令可以有子命令，形成树状结构
5. **自动生成帮助信息**：根据类型定义自动生成 \`--help\` 输出

### 类型安全的选项定义系统

设计选项定义系统的关键是用一个类型对象描述选项，然后通过 TypeScript 的类型推导自动得出解析后的选项类型：

\`\`\`ts
// 选项类型定义
type OptionType = 'string' | 'number' | 'boolean' | 'array';

interface OptionDefinition<T = unknown> {
  type: OptionType;
  description: string;
  default?: T;
  required?: boolean;
  alias?: string;
  choices?: readonly T[]; // 限定可选值
}

type InferOptionType<O extends OptionDefinition> =
  O['type'] extends 'string' ? string :
  O['type'] extends 'number' ? number :
  O['type'] extends 'boolean' ? boolean :
  O['type'] extends 'array' ? string[] :
  never;
\`\`\`

### 命令定义和处理函数的类型匹配

每个命令有自己的选项定义，处理函数接收的参数类型应该从选项定义推导：

\`\`\`ts
interface CommandDefinition<TOptions extends Record<string, OptionDefinition>> {
  name: string;
  description: string;
  options: TOptions;
  handler: (args: ParsedOptions<TOptions>) => void | Promise<void>;
}
\`\`\`

这样，如果处理函数尝试访问不存在的选项，或选项类型使用错误，TypeScript 会报错。

### 配置文件的类型安全加载

CLI 工具通常支持多层配置：命令行参数 > 环境变量 > 项目配置文件 > 用户配置文件 > 默认值。类型安全的配置加载需要：
1. 定义配置 Schema（可以复用选项定义中的类型）
2. 深度合并各层配置
3. 验证最终配置的类型正确性
4. 报告配置错误时给出准确的位置信息

### 插件系统的类型

可扩展的 CLI 需要定义插件接口：

\`\`\`ts
interface CliPlugin<TContext = unknown> {
  name: string;
  version: string;
  register(context: TContext): void | Promise<void>;
  commands?: CommandDefinition<any>[];
  hooks?: Record<string, (...args: any[]) => void>;
}
\`\`\`

类型安全的插件系统应该在注册时验证插件是否符合接口，并且插件之间的依赖关系也应该类型化。

### 交互式输入的类型

现代 CLI 不仅处理参数，还经常与用户交互（输入提示、选择列表、确认对话框）。类型安全的交互应该：
- 每个提示返回的类型由提示类型决定（输入框返回 string，确认返回 boolean，选择列表返回选项类型）
- 条件提示（如果用户选择了 A，才显示 B 问题）的类型推导

### 输出和报告类型

CLI 的输出也需要类型：
- 日志级别（debug/info/warn/error）对应不同处理
- 结构化输出（JSON 格式）需要正确序列化
- 进度条的状态更新类型
- 表格输出的列类型定义

### 本章代码示例

在本章的代码中，我们将构建一个类型安全的迷你 CLI 框架，包括：
1. 类型安全的选项定义和解析系统
2. 命令/子命令注册，处理函数类型与选项类型匹配
3. 参数解析（支持 --long、-short、--no-debug、--key=value、位置参数）
4. 类型安全的配置加载和验证
5. 简单的插件系统
6. 模拟 CLI 执行（不实际读取 process.argv，而是传入模拟参数）
7. 自动帮助文本生成
8. 构建一个 Git 风格的示例 CLI 进行演示
`,
    code: `// ============================================================
// 类型安全的 CLI 框架实现
// 模拟 process.argv 解析，不实际读取命令行参数
// ============================================================

import util from 'util';

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第一部分：核心类型定义
// ------------------------------------------------------------

type OptionValueType = 'string' | 'number' | 'boolean' | 'array';
type ArgumentType = 'string' | 'number';

interface OptionDef<T = unknown> {
  type: OptionValueType;
  description: string;
  default?: T;
  required?: boolean;
  alias?: string;
  choices?: readonly T[];
}

interface ArgumentDef {
  name: string;
  type: ArgumentType;
  description: string;
  required?: boolean;
  default?: string | number;
}

type InferOptionValue<O extends OptionDef> =
  O['type'] extends 'boolean' ? boolean :
  O['type'] extends 'number' ? number :
  O['type'] extends 'string'
    ? (O['choices'] extends readonly (infer C)[] ? C : string)
    : O['type'] extends 'array' ? string[] :
    never;

type ParsedOptions<TOptions extends Record<string, OptionDef>> = {
  [K in keyof TOptions]: TOptions[K]['required'] extends true
    ? InferOptionValue<TOptions[K]>
    : InferOptionValue<TOptions[K]> | undefined;
};

type ParsedArgs<TArgs extends ArgumentDef[]> = {
  [I in keyof TArgs as TArgs[I]['name']]: TArgs[I]['type'] extends 'number' ? number : string;
};

interface CommandContext<
  TOptions extends Record<string, OptionDef> = Record<string, OptionDef>,
  TArgs extends ArgumentDef[] = ArgumentDef[]
> {
  command: string;
  options: ParsedOptions<TOptions>;
  args: ParsedArgs<TArgs>;
  config: Record<string, unknown>;
  logger: CliLogger;
}

type CommandHandler<
  TOptions extends Record<string, OptionDef> = Record<string, OptionDef>,
  TArgs extends ArgumentDef[] = ArgumentDef[]
> = (ctx: CommandContext<TOptions, TArgs>) => void | Promise<void>;

interface CommandDefinition<
  TOptions extends Record<string, OptionDef> = Record<string, OptionDef>,
  TArgs extends ArgumentDef[] = ArgumentDef[]
> {
  name: string;
  description: string;
  options?: TOptions;
  args?: TArgs;
  subcommands?: CommandDefinition<any, any>[];
  handler?: CommandHandler<TOptions, TArgs>;
  aliases?: string[];
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第二部分：类型安全的日志器
// ------------------------------------------------------------

type LogLevel = 'debug' | 'info' | 'warn' | 'error' | 'success';

interface CliLogger {
  debug: (message: string, ...args: unknown[]) => void;
  info: (message: string, ...args: unknown[]) => void;
  warn: (message: string, ...args: unknown[]) => void;
  error: (message: string, ...args: unknown[]) => void;
  success: (message: string, ...args: unknown[]) => void;
  table: (data: Record<string, unknown>[], columns?: string[]) => void;
  plain: (message: string) => void;
  setVerbose: (verbose: boolean) => void;
}

const colors = {
  reset: '\\x1b[0m',
  bright: '\\x1b[1m',
  dim: '\\x1b[2m',
  red: '\\x1b[31m',
  green: '\\x1b[32m',
  yellow: '\\x1b[33m',
  blue: '\\x1b[34m',
  magenta: '\\x1b[35m',
  cyan: '\\x1b[36m',
  white: '\\x1b[37m',
};

function createLogger(verbose = false): CliLogger {
  let isVerbose = verbose;

  const colorize = (color: string, text: string) => {
    if (process.env.NO_COLOR) return text;
    return color + text + colors.reset;
  };

  const prefix = (level: LogLevel) => {
    const prefixes: Record<LogLevel, string> = {
      debug: colorize(colors.dim, '  debug'),
      info: colorize(colors.cyan, '   info'),
      warn: colorize(colors.yellow, '   warn'),
      error: colorize(colors.red, '  error'),
      success: colorize(colors.green, 'success'),
    };
    return prefixes[level];
  };

  return {
    setVerbose(v: boolean) { isVerbose = v; },
    debug(message: string, ...args: unknown[]) {
      if (isVerbose) {
        console.log(prefix('debug'), message, ...args);
      }
    },
    info(message: string, ...args: unknown[]) {
      console.log(prefix('info'), message, ...args);
    },
    warn(message: string, ...args: unknown[]) {
      console.log(prefix('warn'), colorize(colors.yellow, message), ...args);
    },
    error(message: string, ...args: unknown[]) {
      console.error(prefix('error'), colorize(colors.red, message), ...args);
    },
    success(message: string, ...args: unknown[]) {
      console.log(prefix('success'), colorize(colors.green, message), ...args);
    },
    plain(message: string) {
      console.log(message);
    },
    table(data: Record<string, unknown>[], columns?: string[]) {
      if (data.length === 0) {
        console.log('  (空)');
        return;
      }
      const cols = columns || Object.keys(data[0]);
      const colWidths: Record<string, number> = {};
      for (const col of cols) {
        colWidths[col] = Math.max(col.length, ...data.map(r => String(r[col] ?? '').length));
      }
      const header = cols.map(c => c.padEnd(colWidths[c])).join('  ');
      const separator = cols.map(c => '-'.repeat(colWidths[c])).join('  ');
      console.log('  ' + colorize(colors.bright, header));
      console.log('  ' + separator);
      for (const row of data) {
        const line = cols.map(c => String(row[c] ?? '').padEnd(colWidths[c])).join('  ');
        console.log('  ' + line);
      }
    },
  };
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第三部分：参数解析器
// ------------------------------------------------------------

interface ParsedCommand {
  commandPath: string[];
  options: Record<string, unknown>;
  positionalArgs: string[];
}

function parseArgs(rawArgs: string[], optionDefs: Record<string, OptionDef>): ParsedCommand {
  const result: ParsedCommand = {
    commandPath: [],
    options: {},
    positionalArgs: [],
  };

  let i = 0;
  while (i < rawArgs.length) {
    const arg = rawArgs[i];

    if (arg === '--') {
      result.positionalArgs.push(...rawArgs.slice(i + 1));
      break;
    }

    if (arg.startsWith('--')) {
      const eqIndex = arg.indexOf('=');
      let key: string;
      let value: string | boolean = true;

      if (eqIndex !== -1) {
        key = arg.slice(2, eqIndex);
        value = arg.slice(eqIndex + 1);
      } else {
        key = arg.slice(2);
        const nextArg = rawArgs[i + 1];
        const def = findOptionDef(key, optionDefs);

        if (key.startsWith('no-') && (!def || def.type === 'boolean')) {
          key = key.slice(3);
          value = false;
        } else if (def && def.type === 'boolean') {
          value = true;
        } else if (nextArg && !nextArg.startsWith('-')) {
          value = nextArg;
          i++;
        } else if (def && def.type !== 'boolean') {
          value = '';
        } else {
          value = true;
        }
      }

      result.options[normalizeKey(key, optionDefs)] = value;
    } else if (arg.startsWith('-') && arg.length > 1) {
      if (arg.length === 2) {
        const key = arg.slice(1);
        const def = findOptionDef(key, optionDefs);
        const nextArg = rawArgs[i + 1];
        let value: string | boolean = true;

        if (def && def.type !== 'boolean' && nextArg && !nextArg.startsWith('-')) {
          value = nextArg;
          i++;
        }
        result.options[normalizeKey(key, optionDefs)] = value;
      } else {
        for (let j = 1; j < arg.length; j++) {
          result.options[normalizeKey(arg[j], optionDefs)] = true;
        }
      }
    } else {
      result.commandPath.push(arg);
    }
    i++;
  }

  return result;
}

function findOptionDef(key: string, defs: Record<string, OptionDef>): OptionDef | undefined {
  if (defs[key]) return defs[key];
  for (const [name, def] of Object.entries(defs)) {
    if (def.alias === key || name === key) return def;
  }
  return undefined;
}

function normalizeKey(key: string, defs: Record<string, OptionDef>): string {
  for (const [name, def] of Object.entries(defs)) {
    if (def.alias === key || name === key) return name;
  }
  return key;
}

function coerceValue(value: unknown, def: OptionDef): unknown {
  if (value === undefined || value === null || value === '') {
    if (def.default !== undefined) return def.default;
    if (def.type === 'boolean') return false;
    if (def.type === 'array') return [];
    return undefined;
  }

  if (def.type === 'boolean') {
    if (value === 'true' || value === true) return true;
    if (value === 'false' || value === false) return false;
    return Boolean(value);
  }

  if (def.type === 'number') {
    const num = Number(value);
    if (isNaN(num)) throw new Error(\`选项期望数字类型，但得到: \${value}\`);
    return num;
  }

  if (def.type === 'array') {
    if (Array.isArray(value)) return value;
    if (typeof value === 'string') return value.split(',').map(s => s.trim());
    return [String(value)];
  }

  const strValue = String(value);
  if (def.choices && !def.choices.includes(strValue as any)) {
    throw new Error(\`选项值必须是 [\${def.choices.join(', ')}] 之一，得到: \${strValue}\`);
  }

  return strValue;
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第四部分：类型安全的配置加载
// ------------------------------------------------------------

interface ConfigSchema {
  [key: string]: {
    type: 'string' | 'number' | 'boolean';
    default?: unknown;
    description?: string;
  };
}

class ConfigLoader {
  private config: Record<string, unknown> = {};

  load<T extends ConfigSchema>(schema: T, overrides?: Record<string, unknown>): { [K in keyof T]: T[K]['type'] extends 'string' ? string : T[K]['type'] extends 'number' ? number : boolean } {
    const result: Record<string, unknown> = {};
    for (const [key, def] of Object.entries(schema)) {
      const value = overrides?.[key] ?? def.default;
      if (def.type === 'number') {
        result[key] = value !== undefined ? Number(value) : 0;
      } else if (def.type === 'boolean') {
        result[key] = Boolean(value ?? false);
      } else {
        result[key] = value !== undefined ? String(value) : '';
      }
    }
    return result as any;
  }
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第五部分：CLI 应用主类
// ------------------------------------------------------------

interface CliAppOptions {
  name: string;
  version: string;
  description: string;
  globalOptions?: Record<string, OptionDef>;
}

class CliApp {
  private commands: Map<string, CommandDefinition<any, any>> = new Map();
  private plugins: Array<{ name: string; register: (app: CliApp) => void }> = [];
  private logger: CliLogger;
  private configLoader = new ConfigLoader();

  constructor(private options: CliAppOptions) {
    this.logger = createLogger();
    this.registerBuiltInCommands();
  }

  private registerBuiltInCommands(): void {
    this.command({
      name: 'help',
      description: '显示帮助信息',
      options: {
        command: { type: 'string', description: '要查看帮助的命令名', required: false },
      },
      handler: (ctx) => {
        this.printHelp(ctx.options.command as string | undefined);
      },
    });

    this.command({
      name: 'version',
      description: '显示版本信息',
      handler: () => {
        console.log(\`\${this.options.name} v\${this.options.version}\`);
      },
    });
  }

  command<
    TOptions extends Record<string, OptionDef> = Record<string, OptionDef>,
    TArgs extends ArgumentDef[] = ArgumentDef[]
  >(def: CommandDefinition<TOptions, TArgs>): this {
    this.commands.set(def.name, def as CommandDefinition<any, any>);
    if (def.aliases) {
      for (const alias of def.aliases) {
        this.commands.set(alias, def as CommandDefinition<any, any>);
      }
    }
    return this;
  }

  plugin(plugin: { name: string; register: (app: CliApp) => void }): this {
    this.plugins.push(plugin);
    plugin.register(this);
    console.log(\`  [插件] 已加载插件: \${plugin.name}\`);
    return this;
  }

  findCommand(path: string[]): CommandDefinition | null {
    let current: CommandDefinition | undefined;
    let searchMap = this.commands;

    for (let i = 0; i < path.length; i++) {
      const part = path[i];
      current = searchMap.get(part);
      if (!current) return null;

      if (i < path.length - 1 && current.subcommands) {
        const subMap = new Map<string, CommandDefinition>();
        for (const sub of current.subcommands) {
          subMap.set(sub.name, sub);
        }
        searchMap = subMap;
      }
    }

    return current || null;
  }

  async run(rawArgs: string[]): Promise<void> {
    console.log(colorize(colors.cyan, \`\\n\${this.options.name} v\${this.options.version}\`));
    console.log(colorize(colors.dim, this.options.description + '\\n'));

    if (rawArgs.length === 0) {
      this.printHelp();
      return;
    }

    const verbose = rawArgs.includes('--verbose') || rawArgs.includes('-v');
    this.logger.setVerbose(verbose);
    this.logger.debug('原始参数:', rawArgs);

    const globalOptions = this.options.globalOptions || {};
    const parsed = parseArgs(rawArgs, globalOptions);

    if (parsed.commandPath.length === 0) {
      this.printHelp();
      return;
    }

    let cmd: CommandDefinition | null = null;
    let remainingPath = [...parsed.commandPath];
    let matchedPath: string[] = [];
    let searchMap = this.commands;

    for (const part of parsed.commandPath) {
      const found = searchMap.get(part);
      if (found) {
        cmd = found;
        matchedPath.push(part);
        if (found.subcommands) {
          const subMap = new Map<string, CommandDefinition>();
          for (const sub of found.subcommands) {
            subMap.set(sub.name, sub);
            if (sub.aliases) for (const a of sub.aliases) subMap.set(a, sub);
          }
          searchMap = subMap;
        } else {
          break;
        }
      } else {
        break;
      }
    }

    if (!cmd) {
      this.logger.error(\`未知命令: \${parsed.commandPath.join(' ')}\`);
      this.printHelp();
      return;
    }

    const positionalArgs = parsed.commandPath.slice(matchedPath.length);
    const allOptions = { ...globalOptions, ...(cmd.options || {}) };
    const parsedCmd = parseArgs(rawArgs.slice(rawArgs.indexOf(matchedPath[matchedPath.length - 1]) + 1), allOptions);

    const options: Record<string, unknown> = {};
    for (const [name, def] of Object.entries(allOptions)) {
      const value = parsedCmd.options[name] ?? parsed.options[name];
      options[name] = coerceValue(value, def);
      if (def.required && (options[name] === undefined || options[name] === '')) {
        throw new Error(\`必填选项缺失: --\${name}\`);
      }
    }

    for (const [name, def] of Object.entries(allOptions)) {
      if (def.default !== undefined && options[name] === undefined) {
        options[name] = def.default;
      }
    }

    const args: Record<string, string | number> = {};
    if (cmd.args) {
      for (let i = 0; i < cmd.args.length; i++) {
        const argDef = cmd.args[i];
        const rawVal = positionalArgs[i] ?? parsedCmd.positionalArgs[i] ?? argDef.default;
        if (rawVal === undefined) {
          if (argDef.required) {
            throw new Error(\`必填参数缺失: <\${argDef.name}>\`);
          }
          args[argDef.name] = argDef.type === 'number' ? 0 : '';
        } else {
          args[argDef.name] = argDef.type === 'number' ? Number(rawVal) : String(rawVal);
        }
      }
    }

    this.logger.debug('解析的选项:', options);
    this.logger.debug('位置参数:', args);

    if (!cmd.handler) {
      this.logger.error(\`命令 \${matchedPath.join(' ')} 没有处理函数\`);
      this.printCommandHelp(cmd, matchedPath.join(' '));
      return;
    }

    const config = this.configLoader.load({
      outputDir: { type: 'string', default: './dist', description: '输出目录' },
      verbose: { type: 'boolean', default: verbose, description: '详细输出' },
    });

    const ctx: CommandContext = {
      command: matchedPath.join(' '),
      options: options as any,
      args: args as any,
      config,
      logger: this.logger,
    };

    await cmd.handler(ctx);
  }

  printHelp(commandName?: string): void {
    if (commandName) {
      const cmd = this.commands.get(commandName);
      if (cmd) {
        this.printCommandHelp(cmd, commandName);
        return;
      }
    }

    console.log(colorize(colors.bright, '用法:'));
    console.log(\`  \${this.options.name} <命令> [选项]\n\`);

    console.log(colorize(colors.bright, '命令列表:'));
    const commandList: { name: string; description: string }[] = [];
    for (const [name, cmd] of this.commands) {
      if (!cmd.aliases || !cmd.aliases.includes(name)) {
        commandList.push({ name, description: cmd.description });
      }
    }
    commandList.sort((a, b) => a.name.localeCompare(b.name));
    for (const { name, description } of commandList) {
      console.log(\`  \${colorize(colors.cyan, name.padEnd(15))} \${description}\`);
    }

    console.log('');
    console.log(colorize(colors.bright, '全局选项:'));
    console.log(\`  \${colorize(colors.cyan, '-v, --verbose'.padEnd(15))} 启用详细输出\`);
    console.log(\`  \${colorize(colors.cyan, '-h, --help'.padEnd(15))} 显示帮助信息\`);
    console.log(\`  \${colorize(colors.cyan, '--version'.padEnd(15))} 显示版本号\`);
    console.log('');
    console.log(\`运行 "\${this.options.name} help <命令>" 查看具体命令的帮助信息。\\n\`);
  }

  private printCommandHelp(cmd: CommandDefinition, path: string): void {
    console.log(colorize(colors.bright, \`命令: \${path}\`));
    console.log(\`  \${cmd.description}\\n\`);

    if (cmd.args && cmd.args.length > 0) {
      console.log(colorize(colors.bright, '参数:'));
      for (const arg of cmd.args) {
        const required = arg.required ? '<' + arg.name + '>' : '[' + arg.name + ']';
        console.log(\`  \${colorize(colors.cyan, required.padEnd(20))} \${arg.description} (类型: \${arg.type})\`);
      }
      console.log('');
    }

    if (cmd.options && Object.keys(cmd.options).length > 0) {
      console.log(colorize(colors.bright, '选项:'));
      for (const [name, opt] of Object.entries(cmd.options)) {
        const aliasStr = opt.alias ? \`-\${opt.alias}, \` : '    ';
        const defaultStr = opt.default !== undefined ? \` (默认: \${JSON.stringify(opt.default)})\` : '';
        const requiredStr = opt.required ? ' [必填]' : '';
        const choicesStr = opt.choices ? \` [可选值: \${opt.choices.join(', ')}]\` : '';
        const flag = opt.type === 'boolean' ? \`--\${name}\` : \`--\${name} <value>\`;
        console.log(\`  \${aliasStr}\${colorize(colors.cyan, flag.padEnd(25))} \${opt.description}\${defaultStr}\${requiredStr}\${choicesStr}\`);
      }
      console.log('');
    }
  }
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第六部分：插件系统示例
// ------------------------------------------------------------

interface AnalyticsPluginOptions {
  enabled: boolean;
}

function createAnalyticsPlugin(options: AnalyticsPluginOptions = { enabled: true }) {
  return {
    name: 'analytics-plugin',
    register(app: CliApp) {
      if (!options.enabled) return;
      app.command({
        name: 'analytics',
        description: '显示使用统计',
        options: {
          period: { type: 'string', description: '统计周期', default: 'week', choices: ['day', 'week', 'month'] as const },
        },
        handler: (ctx) => {
          ctx.logger.info(\`生成 \${ctx.options.period} 度使用统计报告...\`);
          const data = [
            { command: 'build', count: 156, success: 152, failed: 4 },
            { command: 'serve', count: 89, success: 89, failed: 0 },
            { command: 'test', count: 234, success: 220, failed: 14 },
          ];
          ctx.logger.table(data);
        },
      });
    },
  };
}

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第七部分：构建示例 CLI（类似 Git 的工具）
// ------------------------------------------------------------

console.log('========================================');
console.log('  类型安全 CLI 框架演示');
console.log('========================================\n');

const app = new CliApp({
  name: 'tsdev',
  version: '1.0.0',
  description: 'TypeScript 项目开发工具 - 类型安全的 CLI 示例',
  globalOptions: {
    config: { type: 'string', description: '配置文件路径', alias: 'c', default: './tsdev.config.json' },
    verbose: { type: 'boolean', description: '详细输出', alias: 'v', default: false },
  },
});

// 注册插件
app.plugin(createAnalyticsPlugin({ enabled: true }));

// init 命令
app.command({
  name: 'init',
  description: '初始化新项目',
  options: {
    template: { type: 'string', description: '项目模板', alias: 't', default: 'basic', choices: ['basic', 'express', 'react', 'next'] as const },
    force: { type: 'boolean', description: '强制覆盖已有文件', alias: 'f', default: false },
    git: { type: 'boolean', description: '初始化 Git 仓库', default: true },
    install: { type: 'boolean', description: '自动安装依赖', default: true },
    manager: { type: 'string', description: '包管理器', default: 'pnpm', choices: ['npm', 'yarn', 'pnpm'] as const },
  },
  args: [
    { name: 'projectName', type: 'string', description: '项目名称', required: true },
  ],
  handler: (ctx) => {
    ctx.logger.success(\`正在初始化项目 "\${ctx.args.projectName}"...\`);
    ctx.logger.info(\`模板: \${ctx.options.template}\`);
    ctx.logger.info(\`包管理器: \${ctx.options.manager}\`);
    ctx.logger.info(\`Git 初始化: \${ctx.options.git ? '是' : '否'}\`);
    ctx.logger.info(\`自动安装: \${ctx.options.install ? '是' : '否'}\`);
    if (ctx.options.force) {
      ctx.logger.warn('force 模式：将覆盖已有文件');
    }
    ctx.logger.success('项目初始化完成！');
    ctx.logger.plain('');
    ctx.logger.plain('  下一步:');
    ctx.logger.plain(\`    cd \${ctx.args.projectName}\`);
    ctx.logger.plain('    pnpm install');
    ctx.logger.plain('    pnpm dev');
  },
});

// build 命令
app.command({
  name: 'build',
  description: '构建项目',
  options: {
    output: { type: 'string', description: '输出目录', alias: 'o', default: './dist' },
    mode: { type: 'string', description: '构建模式', alias: 'm', default: 'production', choices: ['development', 'production', 'test'] as const },
    watch: { type: 'boolean', description: '监听模式', alias: 'w', default: false },
    minify: { type: 'boolean', description: '压缩代码', default: true },
    sourcemap: { type: 'boolean', description: '生成 Source Map', default: true },
    target: { type: 'string', description: '目标环境', default: 'es2020' },
  },
  handler: (ctx) => {
    ctx.logger.info(\`开始构建（\${ctx.options.mode} 模式）...\`);
    ctx.logger.info(\`输出目录: \${ctx.options.output}\`);
    ctx.logger.info(\`目标环境: \${ctx.options.target}\`);
    ctx.logger.info(\`压缩: \${ctx.options.minify ? '是' : '否'}\`);
    ctx.logger.info(\`Source Map: \${ctx.options.sourcemap ? '是' : '否'}\`);
    if (ctx.options.watch) {
      ctx.logger.warn('监听模式：文件变更将自动重新构建');
    }

    ctx.logger.debug('编译 TypeScript 文件...');
    ctx.logger.debug('打包资源文件...');
    ctx.logger.debug('生成类型声明...');

    ctx.logger.success('构建完成！');
    const buildInfo = [
      { asset: 'index.js', size: '145 KB', gzip: '42 KB' },
      { asset: 'index.d.ts', size: '12 KB', gzip: '3 KB' },
      { asset: 'vendor.js', size: '890 KB', gzip: '230 KB' },
    ];
    ctx.logger.table(buildInfo, ['asset', 'size', 'gzip']);
  },
});

// serve 命令带子命令
app.command({
  name: 'serve',
  description: '开发服务器相关命令',
  subcommands: [
    {
      name: 'start',
      description: '启动开发服务器',
      options: {
        port: { type: 'number', description: '端口号', alias: 'p', default: 3000 },
        host: { type: 'string', description: '主机地址', default: 'localhost' },
        https: { type: 'boolean', description: '启用 HTTPS', default: false },
        open: { type: 'boolean', description: '自动打开浏览器', alias: 'o', default: false },
      },
      handler: (ctx) => {
        const protocol = ctx.options.https ? 'https' : 'http';
        ctx.logger.success(\`开发服务器启动于 \${protocol}://\${ctx.options.host}:\${ctx.options.port}\`);
        ctx.logger.info('按 Ctrl+C 停止服务器');
      },
    },
    {
      name: 'stop',
      description: '停止开发服务器',
      handler: (ctx) => {
        ctx.logger.success('开发服务器已停止');
      },
    },
    {
      name: 'restart',
      description: '重启开发服务器',
      handler: (ctx) => {
        ctx.logger.info('正在重启开发服务器...');
        ctx.logger.success('服务器已重启');
      },
    },
  ],
  handler: (ctx) => {
    ctx.logger.info('serve 命令需要子命令');
    ctx.logger.plain('可用子命令: start, stop, restart');
  },
});

// test 命令
app.command({
  name: 'test',
  description: '运行测试',
  options: {
    watch: { type: 'boolean', description: '监听模式', alias: 'w', default: false },
    coverage: { type: 'boolean', description: '生成覆盖率报告', default: false },
    pattern: { type: 'string', description: '测试文件匹配模式', default: '**/*.test.ts' },
    update: { type: 'boolean', description: '更新快照', alias: 'u', default: false },
  },
  args: [
    { name: 'testPath', type: 'string', description: '测试路径', required: false },
  ],
  handler: (ctx) => {
    ctx.logger.info('运行测试...');
    ctx.logger.info(\`文件模式: \${ctx.options.pattern}\`);
    if (ctx.args.testPath) {
      ctx.logger.info(\`测试路径: \${ctx.args.testPath}\`);
    }
    if (ctx.options.coverage) {
      ctx.logger.info('覆盖率报告将在测试完成后生成');
    }
    if (ctx.options.update) {
      ctx.logger.warn('更新快照模式');
    }

    const results = [
      { file: 'utils.test.ts', tests: 12, passed: 12, failed: 0, time: '45ms' },
      { file: 'auth.test.ts', tests: 8, passed: 8, failed: 0, time: '120ms' },
      { file: 'api.test.ts', tests: 15, passed: 14, failed: 1, time: '230ms' },
    ];
    ctx.logger.table(results, ['file', 'tests', 'passed', 'failed', 'time']);

    const totalTests = results.reduce((s, r) => s + r.tests, 0);
    const totalPassed = results.reduce((s, r) => s + r.passed, 0);
    const totalFailed = results.reduce((s, r) => s + r.failed, 0);

    if (totalFailed > 0) {
      ctx.logger.error(\`测试失败: \${totalPassed}/\${totalTests} 通过, \${totalFailed} 个失败\`);
    } else {
      ctx.logger.success(\`所有测试通过: \${totalPassed}/\${totalTests}\`);
    }
  },
});

// config 命令
app.command({
  name: 'config',
  description: '配置管理',
  subcommands: [
    {
      name: 'list',
      description: '列出当前配置',
      handler: (ctx) => {
        ctx.logger.info('当前配置:');
        const configData = [
          { key: 'outputDir', value: './dist', source: 'default' },
          { key: 'target', value: 'es2020', source: 'default' },
          { key: 'minify', value: 'true', source: 'default' },
          { key: 'verbose', value: 'false', source: 'cli' },
        ];
        ctx.logger.table(configData);
      },
    },
    {
      name: 'get',
      description: '获取配置项值',
      args: [{ name: 'key', type: 'string', description: '配置键名', required: true }],
      handler: (ctx) => {
        ctx.logger.info(\`\${ctx.args.key} = ./dist\`);
      },
    },
    {
      name: 'set',
      description: '设置配置项',
      args: [
        { name: 'key', type: 'string', description: '配置键名', required: true },
        { name: 'value', type: 'string', description: '配置值', required: true },
      ],
      handler: (ctx) => {
        ctx.logger.success(\`已设置 \${ctx.args.key} = \${ctx.args.value}\`);
      },
    },
  ],
});

// ------------------------------------------------------------
// 第八部分：模拟命令行执行演示
// ------------------------------------------------------------

async function runDemos() {
  const demos: { args: string[]; description: string }[] = [
    { args: [], description: '1. 无参数运行（显示帮助）' },
    { args: ['version'], description: '2. 查看版本' },
    { args: ['init', '--help'], description: '3. 查看 init 命令帮助' },
    { args: ['init', 'my-ts-project', '--template', 'express', '--manager', 'pnpm', '--verbose'], description: '4. 初始化 Express 项目（verbose）' },
    { args: ['build', '--mode', 'production', '--output', './build', '--no-minify'], description: '5. 构建项目（生产模式，不压缩）' },
    { args: ['build', '-w'], description: '6. 构建项目（监听模式，短选项）' },
    { args: ['serve', 'start', '--port', '8080', '--https'], description: '7. 启动开发服务器（HTTPS，端口8080）' },
    { args: ['test', '--coverage', 'src/utils'], description: '8. 运行测试（带覆盖率，指定路径）' },
    { args: ['config', 'list'], description: '9. 列出配置' },
    { args: ['analytics', '--period', 'month'], description: '10. 插件命令：月度统计' },
    { args: ['unknown-cmd'], description: '11. 未知命令（错误处理）' },
    { args: ['build', '--mode', 'invalid'], description: '12. 无效选项值（错误处理）' },
  ];

  for (const demo of demos) {
    console.log('\\n' + colorize(colors.bright, colorize(colors.magenta, \`===== \${demo.description} =====\`)));
    console.log(\`  执行: tsdev \${demo.args.join(' ')}\\n\`);
    try {
      await app.run(demo.args);
    } catch (err: any) {
      console.log(\`  \${colorize(colors.red, '错误:')} \${err.message}\`);
    }
    console.log('');
  }

  console.log(colorize(colors.green, '\\n========================================'));
  console.log(colorize(colors.green, '  CLI 工具开发演示完成！'));
  console.log(colorize(colors.green, '========================================'));
}

function colorize(color: string, text: string) {
  if (process.env.NO_COLOR) return text;
  return color + text + colors.reset;
}

runDemos().catch(console.error);
`,
  },
];


